Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.06,0:00:34.75,Title,0,0,0,0,,《回到未来》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.15,0:01:20.32,Note,0,0,0,0,,（布朗的宅邸被拆毁）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.32,0:01:23.03,Note,0,0,0,0,,（布朗的财产卖给了开发商）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.55,0:01:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,十月是清点货物换季的时节{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}October is inventory time, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.34,0:01:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以现在丰田汽车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so right now, Statler Toyota{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.05,0:01:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在降价{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is making the best deals of the year{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.01,0:01:39.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你再也找不到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}on all 1985-model Toyotas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.34,0:01:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,比丰田1985更好的车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't find a better car{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.89,0:01:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,价钱便宜 服务周到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}at a better price with better service anywhere in Hill Valley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.52,0:01:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是山谷镇的丰田{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Statler Toyota in downtown Hill Valley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.65,0:01:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,参议院今天将对此投票表决{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Senate is expected to vote on this today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.61,0:01:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他方面新闻 太平洋核子研究所的高级官员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In other news, officials at the Pacific Nuclear research facility{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.86,0:02:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,否认了两周前 一箱装有核材料钚的箱子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}have denied the rumor that a case of missing plutonium{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.62,0:02:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,在保险箱中被人盗走的传闻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}was in fact stolen from their vault two weeks ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.95,0:02:06.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,而一利比亚恐怖组织声称{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Libyan terrorist group had claimed responsibility{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.50,0:02:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,对此偷盗事件负责{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the alleged theft.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.79,0:02:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,然而 该高级官员却说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}However, officials now attribute{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.96,0:02:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全是清点错误{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the discrepancy to a simple clerical error.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.88,0:02:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,调查此事的FBI 目前没有表态{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The FBI, which is investigating the matter, had no comment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.85,0:02:44.90,Note,0,0,0,0,,（狗食）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.50,0:02:49.07,Note,0,0,0,0,,（爱因斯坦）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.42,0:02:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 博士？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Doc?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.30,0:03:03.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.60,0:03:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 有人在家吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello! Anybody home?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.72,0:03:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱因斯坦 到这来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Einstein, come here, boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.43,0:03:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,出什么事了？老天！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on? Oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.19,0:03:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Jesus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.77,0:03:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,闻起来真恶心！他在哪啊？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is disgusting. Where the hell is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.03,0:03:21.33,Note,0,0,0,0,,（钚 小心搬运）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.11,0:04:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.15,0:04:43.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,摇滚起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rock 'n' roll.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.95,0:04:53.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁 是你吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marty, is that you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.50,0:04:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 博士 你在哪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Hey, Doc. Where are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.62,0:04:56.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢天谢地 总算找到你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank God I've found you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.88,0:04:59.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 你可否在凌晨 1：15到「双松购物超市」来见我？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, can you meet me at Twin Pines Mall tonight at 1:15?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.38,0:05:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有了新突破 需要你的帮助{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made a major breakthrough, and I'll need your assistance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.21,0:05:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一等 凌晨 1：15？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute. 1:15 in the morning?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.81,0:05:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.59,0:05:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,出什么事了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc, what's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.34,0:05:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 整整一星期你去哪了？- 工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where you been all week? - Working.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.39,0:05:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱因斯坦呢？和你在一起吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Einstein? Is he with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.85,0:05:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 它就在这{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he's right here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.64,0:05:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士 你的仪器整个星期都是开着的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Doc, you left your equipment on all week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.35,0:05:15.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的仪器？我告诉你 马丁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My equipment. That reminds me, Marty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.02,0:05:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,别接通那个扩音器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better not hook up to the amplifier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.56,0:05:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,会超载的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a slight possibility of overload.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.94,0:05:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我记住了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I'll keep that in mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.40,0:05:24.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 咱们晚上见 别忘了是凌晨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. I'll see you tonight. Don't forget now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.90,0:05:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,1：15 双胞胎松林购物广场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}1:15 a.m., Twin Pines Mall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.38,0:05:28.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.58,0:05:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我讨厌敲钟声！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are those my clocks I hear?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.42,0:05:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 8点正了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's 8:00.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.50,0:05:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我迟到了！我还得工作呢！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect! My experiment worked!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.75,0:05:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的钟都整整慢了 25 分钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're all exactly 25 minutes slow!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.26,0:05:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一等 博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute. Wait a minute, Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.84,0:05:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说 现在是 8：25 ？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you telling me that it's 8:25?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.10,0:05:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Precisely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.76,0:05:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！我上学要迟到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn! I'm late for school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.77,0:05:58.58,Note,0,0,0,0,,（钚 小心搬运）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.84,0:06:39.55,Note,0,0,0,0,,（山谷镇）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.36,0:06:47.17,Note,0,0,0,0,,（请投现任市长 戈尔迪·威尔逊 一票）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.74,0:06:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 詹妮弗 - 马丁 别走这条路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jennifer. - Marty, don't go this way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.58,0:06:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯特里克兰正在找你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strickland's looking for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.66,0:07:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你被逮着 就是4次迟到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you get caught, it'll be four tardies in a row.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.00,0:07:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 现在安全了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, come on. I think we're safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.38,0:07:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 这次不是我的错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, this time it wasn't my fault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.59,0:07:08.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是博士把钟调慢了25分钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The doc set all his clocks 25 minutes slow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.01,0:07:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.34,0:07:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还在跟 埃米特·布朗博士混呢 对吗 麦佛莱？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I to understand you're still hanging around with Dr. Emmett Brown, McFly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.22,0:07:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,一张迟到通知单给你 帕克小姐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tardy slip for you, Miss Parker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.06,0:07:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,一张给你 麦佛莱 共4次迟到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And one for you, McFly. I believe that makes four in a row.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.77,0:07:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你个免费的忠告 年轻人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me give you a nickel's worth of free advice, young man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.82,0:07:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个所谓的布朗博士 是危险人物 一个真正的疯子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This so-called Dr. Brown is dangerous. He's a real nutcase.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.07,0:07:30.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,和他在一起 你会惹上大麻烦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hang around with him, you're gonna end up in big trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.57,0:07:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh. Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.57,0:07:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的态度有问题 麦佛莱！你是个懒散的家伙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a real attitude problem, McFly. You're a slacker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.41,0:07:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,当年他在这{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remind me of your father when he went here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.16,0:07:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是个懒散的家伙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a slacker, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.62,0:07:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在可以走了吗 斯特里克兰先生？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I go now, Mr. Strickland?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.79,0:07:44.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说你的乐队在放学后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I noticed your band is on the roster{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.54,0:07:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,要参加舞会演奏测试{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the dance auditions after school today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.63,0:07:49.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何要参加 麦佛莱？你门都没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why even bother, McFly? You don't have a chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.13,0:07:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太像你老爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're too much like your old man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.01,0:07:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦佛莱一族 从来没{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No McFly ever amounted to anything{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.34,0:07:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,在山谷镇的历史里留名{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the history of Hill Valley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.01,0:07:59.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？历史就要改变了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, history is gonna change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.31,0:08:02.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.07,0:08:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,大伙 准备摇滚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, guys, let's rock 'n roll.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.75,0:08:11.63,Note,0,0,0,0,,（舞会演奏测试）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.03,0:08:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.20,0:08:16.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是针头乐队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're the… We're the Pinheads.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.54,0:08:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 二 三{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, two, three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.64,0:08:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 谢谢 谢谢你们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, that's enough. Thank you, fellas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.48,0:08:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下 小伙子们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold it, fellas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.35,0:08:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕你们的声音太大了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid you're just too darn loud.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.44,0:08:49.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.15,0:08:54.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁是下一个？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring up the next group, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.62,0:08:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,竞选连任的戈尔迪·威尔逊市长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Re-elect Mayor "Goldie" Wilson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.45,0:09:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他代表着进步{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Progress is his middle name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.54,0:09:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不敢相信！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Too loud." I can't believe it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.71,0:09:06.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么 不给我们机会在人们面前演奏？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm never gonna get a chance to play in front of anybody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.42,0:09:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁 被拒绝一次 并不是世界末日{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marty, one rejection isn't the end of the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.88,0:09:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想 也许我该放弃音乐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just don't think I'm cut out for music.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.38,0:09:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,可你很棒 马丁 真的很棒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're good, Marty. You're really good, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.42,0:09:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且你的试听带也相当不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and this audition tape of yours is great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.30,0:09:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该把它寄给唱片公司{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've gotta send it in to the record company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.47,0:09:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就像博士说的那样 - 我知道 我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's like Doc's always saying. - Yeah, I know. I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.30,0:09:20.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,「只要你一心一意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"If you put your mind to it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.43,0:09:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,做什么都成「{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can accomplish anything."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.02,0:09:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个很好的忠告{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's good advice, Marty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.10,0:09:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好吧 詹尼弗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, okay, Jennifer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.65,0:09:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我寄出的带子他们不喜欢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if I send in the tape and they don't like it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.69,0:09:30.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们说我很糟？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if they say I'm no good?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.69,0:09:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们说：从这里滚出去 小鬼！没前途！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if they say, "Get out of here, kid. You got no future"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.07,0:09:36.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 我不知道 是否受得了这样的拒绝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I just don't think I can take that kind of rejection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.36,0:09:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 我像极了我的父亲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, I'm starting to sound like my old man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.45,0:09:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 得了 他还不算太遭 - 救救钟楼！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. He's not that bad. - Save the clock tower.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.28,0:09:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少他给你买了辆车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least he's letting you borrow the car tomorrow night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.50,0:09:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 四轮驱动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check out that 4x4.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.92,0:09:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,真棒！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is hot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.50,0:09:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,停在这{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Back her up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.83,0:09:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,总有一天 詹尼弗 总有一天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someday, Jennifer. Someday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.55,0:09:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,开着这车到湖边 不是很棒吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldn't it be great to take that truck up to the lake?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.05,0:10:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,钻进车后的睡袋里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Throw a couple of sleeping bags in the back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.39,0:10:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着繁星在上…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lie out underneath the stars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.43,0:10:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 停下 - 怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop it. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.10,0:10:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈妈知道吗 明晚的事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does your mom know? About tomorrow night?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.81,0:10:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,出镇的事吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, get out of town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.11,0:10:13.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还以为我是和那帮朋友露营{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mom thinks I'm going camping with the guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.94,0:10:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹尼弗 如果她知道我和你在一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jennifer, my mother would freak out{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.61,0:10:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会疯掉的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}if she knew I was going up there with you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.03,0:10:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,她总是一本正经的说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'd get the standard lecture about{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.28,0:10:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,她当年从没做过这种无聊的事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}how she never did that kind of stuff when she was a kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.74,0:10:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 她生来就是个修女{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, look, I think the woman was born a nun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.70,0:10:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为她只是想 让你保持举止端正{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's just trying to keep you respectable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.29,0:10:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 那么她做得并不成功{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, she's not doing a very good job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.54,0:10:30.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,是糟透了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Terrible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.83,0:10:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救钟楼！救救钟楼！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save the clock tower. Save the clock tower.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.59,0:10:38.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,威尔逊市长提出议案 欲更换那个钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mayor Wilson is sponsoring an initiative to replace that clock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.72,0:10:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,30年前 闪电击中钟楼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thirty years ago, lightning struck that clock tower{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.39,0:10:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,从此钟楼停摆了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the clock hasn't run since.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.22,0:10:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们山谷镇文物保护协会认为{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We at the Hill Valley Preservation Society{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.60,0:10:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该完整的保留下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}think it should be preserved exactly the way it is{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.10,0:10:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是我们历史和传统的一部分{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}as part of our history and heritage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.94,0:10:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你 女士 25美分{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go, lady. There's a quarter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.06,0:10:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.19,0:10:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,别忘了拿份传单{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't forget to take a flyer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.32,0:10:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.40,0:10:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救钟楼！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save the clock tower!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.99,0:10:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们说到哪了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where were we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.07,0:11:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,就说到这{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right about here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.24,0:11:02.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹尼弗！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jennifer!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.41,0:11:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我爸爸 我得走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my dad. I've got to go. Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.87,0:11:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚给你电话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll call you tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.41,0:11:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去祖母家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be at my grandma's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.62,0:11:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你电话号码{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, let me give you the number.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.05,0:11:19.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.44,0:11:27.84,Note,0,0,0,0,,（我爱你！）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.52,0:11:51.02,Note,0,0,0,0,,（里昂住宅区）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.30,0:12:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,BTD 6-2-9{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bravo, Tango, Delta 6-2-9.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.39,0:12:08.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要拖车 收到的单位快回复{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tow for impoundment. Any unit, please respond.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.89,0:12:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了 真是太好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect. Just perfect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.94,0:12:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不能相信你竟然{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe you'd loan me your car{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.20,0:12:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,借给我一辆有问题的车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}without telling me it had a blind spot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.11,0:12:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要我被撞死吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blind spot? I could've been killed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.07,0:12:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝夫 听着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Biff, now, I never noticed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.49,0:12:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,此前我开车的时候 从没见到有什么问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the car had any blind spot before when I would drive it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.58,0:12:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 儿子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.08,0:12:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你瞎了眼了 麦佛莱？就在那儿！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, are you blind, McFly? It's there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.38,0:12:38.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面那堆废铁你怎么解释？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How else do you explain that wreck out there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.34,0:12:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝夫 我能说个请求吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Biff, can I assume{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.76,0:12:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,该拿…你的保险金 来赔偿车子的损坏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that your insurance is going to pay for the damage?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.88,0:12:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的保险金？这可是你的车！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My insurance? It's your car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.26,0:12:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己赔去吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your insurance should pay for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.56,0:12:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想知道谁来赔偿这个？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna know who's going to pay for this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.18,0:12:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,出事时 车子把酒洒我到衣服上了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I spilled beer all over it when the car smashed into me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.14,0:12:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁来付我的清洗帐单呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's gonna pay my cleaning bill?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.39,0:12:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的报告在哪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And where's my reports?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.44,0:12:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还没做完{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I haven't finished those up yet, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.02,0:13:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你知道 我正在做…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I figured since they weren't due till…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.78,0:13:03.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 喂 有人在家吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello? Hello? Anybody home? Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.40,0:13:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,想一想！麦佛莱！想一想！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think, McFly. Think! All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.78,0:13:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还得花时间重新打字呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to have time to get them retyped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.95,0:13:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我直接将你的手写报告交上去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you realize what would happen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.29,0:13:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道会发生什么吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}if I hand in my reports in your handwriting?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.16,0:13:14.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会被开除的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get fired.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.79,0:13:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不想让这样的事情发生吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't want that to happen, would you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.67,0:13:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吧？- 当然 贝夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Would you? - Of course not, Biff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.67,0:13:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不希望这样的事情发生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I wouldn't want that to happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.21,0:13:25.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我今晚就完成报告{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, look. I'll finish those reports on up tonight, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.13,0:13:27.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天一大早就给你送去 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'll run them on over first thing tomorrow, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.05,0:13:29.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,别太早了 星期六我睡懒觉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not too early. I sleep in Saturday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.97,0:13:31.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 你鞋带松了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}McFly, your shoe's untied.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.39,0:13:34.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,别犯傻了 麦佛莱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be so gullible, McFly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.85,0:13:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,把撞坏的地方修好 麦佛莱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got the place fixed up nice, though, McFly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.02,0:13:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我大老远把车给你拖来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have your car towed all the way to your house{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.15,0:13:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,就给我喝这么淡的酒吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and all you got for me is lite beer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.78,0:13:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,看什么看 呆小子？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you looking at, butthead?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.25,0:13:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,代我向你妈问好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say hi to your mom for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.08,0:14:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你要说什么 孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what you're going to say, Son, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.17,0:14:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是对的 没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're right. You're right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.97,0:14:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,但贝夫是我的主管{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Biff just happens to be my supervisor, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.18,0:14:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我我不善应对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm afraid I'm just not very good at confrontations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.68,0:14:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这车子 爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the car, Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.27,0:14:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我意思是 他弄坏了车 就得为此负责{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, he wrecked it. He totaled it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.86,0:14:24.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我非常需要这车 爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I needed that car tomorrow night, Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.03,0:14:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道这车对我有多重要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any idea how important this was to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.28,0:14:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any clue?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.40,0:14:31.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 但我只能说…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, and all I can say is, I'm…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.62,0:14:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.37,0:14:35.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 马丁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me, Marty, you're better off{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.83,0:14:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,别为这些事情头疼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}without having to worry about all the aggravation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.83,0:14:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,伤脑筋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and headaches of playing at that dance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.17,0:14:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的很对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's absolutely right, Marty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.92,0:14:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,别为那些事伤脑筋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last thing you need is headaches.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.26,0:14:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们 这蛋糕我们得自己吃了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kids, we're going to have to eat this cake by ourselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.48,0:15:00.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔伊叔叔的假释又没通过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Uncle Joey didn't make parole again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.02,0:15:02.59,Note,0,0,0,0,,（欢迎乔伊叔叔回来！）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.23,0:15:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们最好给他写封信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it would be nice if you all dropped him a line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.65,0:15:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个「囚鸟叔叔」乔伊吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uncle "Jailbird" Joey?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.49,0:15:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他到底是不是你弟弟呀 妈妈？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's your brother, Mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.03,0:15:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个蹲监狱的叔叔 真是奇耻大辱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I think it's a major embarrassment, having an uncle in prison.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.28,0:15:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一生中都会犯错 孩子们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all make mistakes in life, children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.24,0:15:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 我要迟到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}God damn it. I'm late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.04,0:15:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,大卫 管好你的嘴！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}David, watch your mouth!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.79,0:15:22.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,到这来 走之前亲亲你的妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You come here and kiss your mother before you go. Come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.46,0:15:25.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 快点 我要错过巴士了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Mom. Make it fast. I'll miss my bus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.00,0:15:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you later, Pop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.59,0:15:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,该换发油了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to change that oil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.47,0:15:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 马丁 我可不是你的电话答复员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Marty. I'm not your answering service.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.10,0:15:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才你在外头 为车子伤脑筋那阵子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}While you were outside pouting over the car, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.60,0:15:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹妮弗·帕克给你打了两次电话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jennifer Parker called you twice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.94,0:15:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢她 马丁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like her, Marty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.44,0:15:46.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,打电话给男孩的女孩只会惹麻烦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any girl who calls up a boy is just asking for trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.65,0:15:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 女孩打电话给男孩没什么错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Mother, there's nothing wrong with calling a boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.61,0:15:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为这糟透了 女孩追男孩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's terrible. Girls chasing boys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.53,0:15:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在你这年纪 从没追过男孩 打电话给男孩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I was your age, I never chased a boy or called a boy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.95,0:15:59.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,和男孩坐在车里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or sat in a parked car with a boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.16,0:16:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 那我怎么找对象啊？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then how am I supposed to ever meet anybody?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.71,0:16:06.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会遇到的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it'll just happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.25,0:16:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像我遇见你们的父亲一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like the way I met your father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.63,0:16:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样太傻了 是外公的车子撞到了他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was so stupid. Grandpa hit him with the car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.05,0:16:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是命中注定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was meant to be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.68,0:16:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果外公没撞倒他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, if Grandpa hadn't hit him, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.26,0:16:19.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,就不会有你们几个了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}then none of you would have been born.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.02,0:16:21.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.89,0:16:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不知道 那时老爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still don't understand what Dad was doing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.73,0:16:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,在路中间干什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the middle of the street.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.23,0:16:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那时在干什么 乔治？看鸟吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was it, George? Bird-watching?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.77,0:16:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 洛莲？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, Lorraine? What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.40,0:16:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎样 你们外公的车把他撞倒了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, your Grandpa hit him with the car{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.40,0:16:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他带到房里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and brought him into the house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.49,0:16:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他看起来是那样的无助{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He seemed so helpless, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.16,0:16:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像一只迷路的小狗 我的心就这样被他带走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}like a little lost puppy, and my heart just went out to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.25,0:16:47.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 这故事你讲了无数次了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Mom, we know. You've told us this story a million times.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.50,0:16:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得很对不起他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You felt sorry for him, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.92,0:16:50.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是你决定和他一起走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you decided to go with him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.46,0:16:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,去那个「海里之鱼舞会」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the Fish Under the Sea dance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.09,0:16:55.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 是「海中魅力舞会」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. It was the Enchantment Under the Sea dance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.09,0:16:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的第一次约会 我永生不忘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our first date. I'll never forget it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.68,0:17:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在暴风雨的那个晚上 还记得吗 乔治？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was the night of that terrible thunderstorm, remember, George?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.02,0:17:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们父亲在舞池里第一次吻了我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father kissed me for the very first time on that dance floor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.86,0:17:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在那一刻我明白了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was then that I realized{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.11,0:17:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我余下的生命时光 将要和他一同度过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I was going to spend the rest of my life with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.02,0:17:47.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.15,0:17:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁 你没睡着吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marty, you didn't fall asleep, did you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.69,0:17:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.19,0:17:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 博士 没有 别傻了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, don't be silly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.99,0:17:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 这很重要 我忘了拿摄像机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, this is very important. I forgot my video camera.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.03,0:17:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能否在来购物超市之前 到我那去拿吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you stop by my place and pick it up on your way to the mall?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.95,0:18:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以 我这就去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I'm on my way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.46,0:18:12.37,Note,0,0,0,0,,（双松购物超市）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.25,0:18:16.44,Note,0,0,0,0,,（布朗博士公司）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.89,0:18:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱因斯坦 博士在那里呢？你知道吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Einstein! Hey, Einstein, where's the doc, boy? Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.24,0:19:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.66,0:19:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁 你终于来了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marty! You made it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.08,0:19:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.21,0:19:31.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到我的最新试验 这是个大试验{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to my latest experiment. This is the big one, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.37,0:19:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一生的时间都在等待它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the one I've been waiting for all my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.33,0:19:34.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's a DeLorean…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.88,0:19:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,稍安勿躁 你会知道的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bear with me, Marty. All your questions will be answered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.80,0:19:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,装上磁带{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roll tape and we'll proceed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.21,0:19:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.34,0:19:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就这样穿吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is that a DEVO suit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.42,0:19:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管了 不管了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never mind that now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.80,0:19:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.97,0:19:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我准备好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. I'm ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.64,0:19:46.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上好 我是 埃米特·布朗博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening. I'm Dr. Emmett Brown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.43,0:19:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正站在双松购物超市停车场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm standing on the parking lot at Twin Pines Mall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.68,0:19:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是1985年10月26日 凌晨1点18分{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Saturday morning, October 26, 1985, 1:18 a.m., {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.35,0:19:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是1号临时试验{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and this is temporal experiment number one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.69,0:19:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 爱因斯坦 到那儿去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Einie. Hey, hey, boy, get in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.82,0:19:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,乖孩子 坐好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That a boy! In you go. Sit down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.07,0:20:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,系好安全带 就这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put your seat belt on. That's it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.83,0:20:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.54,0:20:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,请注意爱因斯坦的钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please note that Einstein's clock{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.25,0:20:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间和我的完全同步{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is in precise synchronization with my control watch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.29,0:20:17.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it? Right. Check, Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.92,0:20:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,对上了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.09,0:20:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,旅途愉快 爱因斯坦 小心你的头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a good trip, Einstein. Watch your head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.72,0:20:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这东西能遥控车子吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got that thing hooked up to the car?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.31,0:20:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.39,0:20:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Okay. Got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.82,0:20:40.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.87,0:20:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,别拍我！拍车子！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not me! The car! The car!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.88,0:21:07.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我计算正确{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If my calculations are correct, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.72,0:21:10.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时速达到88英里时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}when this baby hits 88 miles per hour{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.81,0:21:12.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,会有惊人的事情发生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're going to see some serious shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.84,0:21:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,看好了 看好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch this. Watch this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.66,0:22:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么跟你说的了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did I tell you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.08,0:22:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,时速88英里！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}88 miles per hour!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.62,0:22:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,车子消失了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The temporal displacement occurred{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.21,0:22:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,正好是在 1：20 零秒！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}exactly 1:20 a.m. And zero seconds!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.30,0:22:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的老天！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus Christ!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.26,0:22:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 博士 你把爱因斯坦分解了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus Christ, Doc! You disintegrated Einstein!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.76,0:22:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,镇定 马丁 我可没分解任何东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calm down, Marty. I didn't disintegrate anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.47,0:22:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在车里完好如初{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The molecular structure of both Einstein and the car are completely intact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.27,0:22:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,可它们到底在哪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then where the hell are they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.73,0:22:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,恰当的问法是：{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The appropriate question is, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.31,0:22:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,「它们到底在什么时间？」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"When the hell are they?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.94,0:22:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 爱因斯坦成为了世界上第一个时间旅行者！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, Einstein has just become the world's first time traveler.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.90,0:22:48.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把它送到了未来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sent him into the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.57,0:22:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,正好是未来的1分钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One minute into the future, to be exact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.03,0:22:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,当正好到1：21 零秒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}At precisely 1:21 a.m. And zero seconds, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.33,0:22:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就会在那时间机器里找到它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we shall catch up with him and the time machine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.75,0:23:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一等 等一等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute. Wait a minute, Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.42,0:23:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士 你是说 你把一台时间机器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you telling me that you built a time machine{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.51,0:23:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,装在了那高级跑车里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}out of a DeLorean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.72,0:23:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要说呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way I see it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.84,0:23:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然要把时间机器造在车里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you're going to build a time machine into a car, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.80,0:23:15.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何不摩登一些呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}why not do it with some style?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.72,0:23:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且这样的结构很有帮助…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, the stainless-steel construction made the flux dispersal…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.52,0:23:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,当心！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.82,0:24:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？很烫？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Is it hot?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.03,0:24:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,很冷 冷极了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's cold. Damn cold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.45,0:24:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱因斯坦！小家伙！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Einstein, you little devil!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.87,0:24:19.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱因斯坦的表 正好比我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Einstein's clock is exactly one minute{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.75,0:24:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢了1分钟！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}behind mine and still ticking!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.83,0:24:26.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它没事？- 它好得很{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's all right. - He's fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.92,0:24:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,它什么都不会感觉到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he's completely unaware that anything happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.34,0:24:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,对它而言这是瞬间完成的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As far as he's concerned, the trip was instantaneous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.05,0:24:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是为什么它的钟比我的慢1分钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why his watch is exactly one minute behind mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.72,0:24:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,它完全跳过了那一分钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He skipped over that minute{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.89,0:24:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞬间到达现在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to instantly arrive at this moment in time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.85,0:24:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 让你看看如何操作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here. I'll show you how it works.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.77,0:24:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.56,0:24:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先 把时间电路打开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}First, you turn the time circuits on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.36,0:24:50.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个显示「将来」要去的时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This readout tells you where you're going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.78,0:24:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个显示「现在」所在的时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one tells you where you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.07,0:24:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个显示「原来」所在的时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one tells you where you were.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.65,0:24:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,用这个键盘输入你的目标时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You input your destination time on this keypad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.07,0:24:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如 你想去见证{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say you want to see the signing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.41,0:24:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,独立宣言的签署{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the Declaration of Independence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.75,0:25:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者去看看耶稣的诞生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or witness the birth of Christ.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.83,0:25:09.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是这个 科学的重要历史时刻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's a red-letter date in the history of science.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.55,0:25:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,1955年11月5日{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}November 5th, 1955.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.09,0:25:20.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 当然 1955年11月5日{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, of course. November 5th, 1955.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.31,0:25:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,那天发生什么事了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? I don't get it. What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.19,0:25:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我发明时间旅行的日子 我记得很清楚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was the day I invented time travel. I remember it vividly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.61,0:25:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那天我正站在马桶上要挂钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was standing on the edge of my toilet, hanging a clock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.73,0:25:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,地板很湿 我滑倒了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The porcelain was wet. I slipped, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.14,0:25:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,脑袋撞在水池边上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}hit my head on the edge of the sink, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.57,0:25:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,当舒醒的时候 我看到了启示{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and when I came to, I had a revelation, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.70,0:25:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个幻影 一张图片 呈现于我脑中 就是这个东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}a vision, a picture in my head, a picture of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.83,0:25:44.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是它 使时间旅行成为可能 通量电容器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what makes time travel possible. The flux capacitor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.12,0:25:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么电容器？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flux capacitor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.42,0:25:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我耗费了30年时间 用尽所有家产{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's taken me almost 30 years and my entire family fortune{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.96,0:25:51.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,去实现那天的幻影{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to realize the vision of that day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.46,0:25:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天 多么长的时间啊？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God, has it been that long?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.38,0:25:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里一切都变了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things have certainly changed around here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.18,0:26:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得当时这里是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember when this was all farmland{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.14,0:26:02.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,一望无际的农田{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}as far as the eye could see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.52,0:26:05.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,全都是一个皮博迪的老头的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Old man Peabody owned all of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.23,0:26:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有个疯狂的念头 繁殖松树{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had this crazy idea about breeding pine trees.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.94,0:26:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真是个…重要的日子 博士 棒极了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is heavy-duty, Doc. This is great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.86,0:26:21.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,它用的是普通的无铅汽油吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does it run on regular unleaded gasoline?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.49,0:26:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,很不幸 不是 它需要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unfortunately, no. It requires something{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.16,0:26:25.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,更大的功力 它用钚！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a little more kick. Plutonium.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.75,0:26:27.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,钚？等一等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plutonium. Wait a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.71,0:26:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说 这东西是核能驱动的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you telling me that this sucker is nuclear?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.17,0:26:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！嘿！继续拍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey! Keep rolling. Keep rolling there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.25,0:26:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不！它用电驱动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, this sucker's electrical, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.17,0:26:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,但只有核反应{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I need a nuclear reaction{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.46,0:26:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,才能产生所需的1.21兆瓦电能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to generate the 1.21 gigawatts of electricity I need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.01,0:26:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士 你不可能在商店里买到钚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc, you don't just walk into a store and buy plutonium.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.18,0:26:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你偷来的吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you rip that off?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.98,0:26:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然不是 我从利比亚民族分子那里弄到的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course. From a group of Libyan nationalists.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.69,0:26:49.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要我造炸弹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They wanted me to build them a bomb, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.98,0:26:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拿走了他们的钚 留下一个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I took their plutonium and, in turn, gave them a shoddy bomb casing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.52,0:26:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,玩具零件做的假弹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}full of used pinball machine parts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.36,0:26:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 过来 准备添加钚燃料… - 天哪！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. Let's get you a radiation suit. - Jesus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.36,0:26:57.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备加料{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must prepare to reload.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.89,0:27:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在安全了 脱下面罩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's safe now. Everything's lead-lined.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.27,0:27:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,别把录像带弄丢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you lose those tapes now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.48,0:27:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need that as a record.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.48,0:27:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,放在这里 好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's put this back here. There we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.20,0:27:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,忘了拿行李{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I almost forgot my luggage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.07,0:27:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁知道未来有没有棉衣？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who knows if they've got cotton underwear in the future?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.91,0:27:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对合成材料过敏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm allergic to all synthetics.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.29,0:27:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,未来？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The future?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.70,0:27:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么你要去哪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's where you're going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.79,0:27:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,25年后的未来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right, 25 years into the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.42,0:27:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直梦想看到人类未来 开开眼界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've always dreamed of seeing the future, looking beyond my years, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.54,0:27:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看人类的进步{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}seeing the progress of mankind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.75,0:27:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.05,0:28:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也能看到25年后 世界球赛的获胜队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll also be able to see who wins the next 25 World Series.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.22,0:28:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.43,0:28:04.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.64,0:28:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,到那之后 别忘了看看我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look me up when you get there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.77,0:28:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,会的 录像{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indeed, I will. Roll 'em.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.65,0:28:19.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 埃米特·布朗博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, Dr. Emmett Brown, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.69,0:28:23.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,将开始一次历史性的旅行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}am about to embark on an historic journey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.49,0:28:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在想什么啊？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I thinking of?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.12,0:28:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我差点忘了带额外的钚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I almost forgot to bring extra plutonium.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.70,0:28:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可怎么回来啊？一份钚 一次旅行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did I ever expect to get back? One pellet, one trip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.33,0:28:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定是昏了头了 对不对？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must be out of my mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.92,0:28:38.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 宝贝？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it, Einie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.05,0:28:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.68,0:28:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们找到我了！真不知他们是怎么找到我的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They found me. I don't know how, but they found me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.56,0:28:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑 马丁！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run for it, Marty!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.73,0:28:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁？谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who? Who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.23,0:28:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为是谁？是那些利比亚人！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who do you think? The Libyans!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.94,0:29:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.49,0:29:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来还击！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll draw their fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.29,0:29:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士 等等！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc, wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.93,0:29:32.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.23,0:29:34.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,混蛋！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bastard!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.66,0:29:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,追！俄罗斯的垃圾枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Damn Soviet gun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.96,0:30:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,追！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.88,0:30:45.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,快呀！快呀！见鬼！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Move, damn it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.63,0:30:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.11,0:31:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,真要命！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.32,0:31:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,看你能不能加速到90英里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see if you bastards can do 90.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.84,0:32:07.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么 保罗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it? What is it, Pa?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.92,0:32:11.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,像是飞机 但怎么没翅膀？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like an airplane without wings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.76,0:32:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 它不是飞机 你看！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That ain't no airplane. Look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.39,0:32:18.87,Note,0,0,0,0,,（太空传奇 来自冥王星的僵尸）
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.66,0:32:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Children!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.99,0:32:38.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen… Whoa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.01,0:32:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.34,0:32:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.14,0:33:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉弄坏了谷仓{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry about your barn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.15,0:33:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,它变成人样了！快开枪！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's already mutated into human form! Shoot it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.36,0:33:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚开！你这个外星杂种！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take that, you mutated son of a bitch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.91,0:33:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get away!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.33,0:33:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.79,0:33:22.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,快开枪！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot it, Pa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.79,0:33:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,杂种！…「皮博迪」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My pine! Why you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.88,0:33:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,外星杂种 你弄死了我的松树！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You space bastard! You killed our pine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.34,0:33:35.06,Note,0,0,0,0,,（双松种植场）
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.68,0:33:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 麦佛莱 麦佛莱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. All right. Okay, McFly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.72,0:33:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒 这只是场梦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get a grip on yourself. It's all a dream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.93,0:33:44.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,一场非常刺激的梦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a very intense dream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.75,0:34:08.63,Note,0,0,0,0,,（里昂住宅区）
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.86,0:34:21.14,Note,0,0,0,0,,（欢迎入住 里昂住宅区）
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.98,0:34:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 你们得帮帮我…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, you got to help me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.31,0:34:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,别停下！他会杀了我们的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't stop, Wilbur! Don't!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.65,0:34:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can't be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.07,0:34:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是疯了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is nuts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.83,0:34:48.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,快发动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.12,0:34:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.80,0:34:54.24,Note,0,0,0,0,,（钚燃料箱：空）
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.73,0:35:20.30,Note,0,0,0,0,,（山谷镇 2英里）
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.27,0:36:45.80,Note,0,0,0,0,,（欢迎来到 山谷镇）
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.82,0:36:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,别忘了 前途就在你们手中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember, fellow citizens, the future is in your hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.45,0:36:53.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们想要进步 请投 托马斯 一票{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you believe in progress, re-elect Mayor Red Thomas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.33,0:36:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他代表着进步{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Progress is his middle name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.46,0:36:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷德·托马斯 市长的政见就是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mayor Red Thomas' progress platform{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.13,0:37:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,更多的工作 更好的教育{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}means more jobs, better education, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.76,0:37:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,更多人权 更少税收{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}bigger civic improvements and lower taxes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.93,0:37:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,选举之日 投票给众望所归的领袖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}On election day, cast your vote for a proven leader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.72,0:37:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷德·托马斯 连任市长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Re-elect Mayor Red Thomas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.47,0:37:12.29,Note,0,0,0,0,,（1955年11月5日）
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.35,0:37:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这准是场梦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This has got to be a dream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.77,0:37:19.36,Note,0,0,0,0,,（公用电话）
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.37,0:37:35.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,年轻人 你干什么了？刚跳船吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, kid. What'd you do? Jump ship?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.37,0:37:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.46,0:37:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么穿着救生衣？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's with the life preserver?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.09,0:37:45.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要用电话机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to use the phone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.47,0:37:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,在后面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's in the back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.60,0:37:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃米特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.31,0:37:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你 没错了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. You're alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.70,0:38:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,快接电话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.46,0:38:17.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道河滨路 1640号在哪里吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know where 1640 Riverside…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.42,0:38:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,要点什么 年轻人？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you going to order something, kid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.67,0:38:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我一杯「啤酒」（现代俚语）{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Give me a Tab.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.88,0:38:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,水龙头（与「啤酒」同音）？那可不行 你要些别的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tab? I can't give you a tab unless you order something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.38,0:38:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我杯「百事」可乐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Give me a Pepsi Free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.55,0:38:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要付帐单（与「百事」同音） 你得先要些东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want a Pepsi, pal, you're going to pay for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.39,0:38:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,就给我些不加糖的饮料好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just give me something without any sugar in it, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.68,0:38:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不加糖的饮料{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something without sugar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.07,0:38:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 麦佛莱！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, McFly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.95,0:38:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为你在干什么呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think you're doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.53,0:38:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Biff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.87,0:38:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在和你说话呢 你这个爱尔兰臭虫！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm talking to you, McFly, you Irish bug!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.45,0:38:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 贝夫！伙计们 你们怎么在这儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Biff. Hey, guys. How are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.71,0:38:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的作业做完了吗？麦佛莱？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got my homework finished, McFly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.08,0:39:02.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 实际上我忘了 星期一才交 所以…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, actually, I figured since it wasn't due till Monday…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.88,0:39:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂？喂？有人在家吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello? Hello? Anybody home?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.26,0:39:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,想一想！麦佛莱！想一想！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think, McFly. Think! Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.22,0:39:10.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还得花时间抄呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to have time to recopy it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.18,0:39:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我交上有你笔迹的作业{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You realize what would happen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.43,0:39:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道会发生什么吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}if I hand in my homework in your handwriting?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.01,0:39:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会被踢出学校{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get kicked out of school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.81,0:39:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不想让这样的事情发生吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't want that to happen, would you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.15,0:39:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.27,0:39:22.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然不会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, of course not, Biff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.40,0:39:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不希望这样的事情发生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I wouldn't want that to happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.40,0:39:25.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,看什么看 呆小子！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you looking at, butthead?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.03,0:39:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,看那 贝夫！他穿着救生衣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Biff, get a load of this guy's life preserver.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.45,0:39:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他以为会被淹死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dork thinks he's going to drown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.24,0:39:32.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的作业怎么办 麦佛莱？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about my homework, McFly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.24,0:39:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 贝夫 我今晚就完成报告{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Biff. Well, I'll finish that on up tonight{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.62,0:39:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天一大早就给你送去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then I'll bring it over first thing tomorrow morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.00,0:39:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,别太早 星期天我睡懒觉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not too early. I sleep in Sundays.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.62,0:39:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦佛莱 你鞋带松了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, McFly, your shoe's untied!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.13,0:39:46.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,别犯傻了 麦佛莱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be so gullible, McFly. Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.25,0:39:47.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想在这再看到你！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to see you in here again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.42,0:39:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 再见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. All right. Bye-bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.95,0:40:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.03,0:40:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是 乔治·麦佛莱？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're George McFly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.87,0:40:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 你是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.33,0:40:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,懒散的家伙 你怎么能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say! Why do you let those boys{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.04,0:40:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们这样耍你？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}push you around like that for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.62,0:40:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们块头比我大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they're bigger than me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.00,0:40:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,要有骨气 你得自重些{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand tall, boy. Have some respect for yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.71,0:40:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道 他们现在这样利用你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you know, if you let people walk over you now, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.00,0:40:28.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,以后会利用你一辈子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}they'll be walking over you for the rest of your life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.17,0:40:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我 你以为{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me. You think I'm gonna{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.67,0:40:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会在这个小店里呆一辈子吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}spend the rest of my life in this slop house?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.42,0:40:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 说话小心点 - 不 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Watch it, Goldie. - No, sir!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.30,0:40:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要干大事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna make something of myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.59,0:40:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在上夜校{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to night school, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.89,0:40:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,总有一天我要当上大人物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and one day, I'm going to be somebody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.18,0:40:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 他会当上市长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right. He's going to be mayor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.14,0:40:41.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.19,0:40:43.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,市长？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mayor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.31,0:40:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个好主意 我可以竞选市长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that's a good idea! I could run for mayor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.32,0:40:49.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑人市长？真是个奇迹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A colored mayor. That'll be the day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.90,0:40:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你等着 我会当上市长的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wait and see, Mr. Caruthers. I will be mayor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.32,0:40:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要成为山谷镇最有势力的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be the most powerful man in Hill Valley, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.70,0:40:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要好好清理这个镇子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm going to clean up this town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.57,0:40:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 你先从清理地板开始{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. You can start by sweeping the floor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.08,0:41:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,威尔逊市长 我喜欢听到这句话！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mayor Goldie Wilson. I like the sound of that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.01,0:41:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.72,0:41:22.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸…乔治 你还有自行车！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Dad! George! Hey, you on the bike!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.42,0:41:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个偷窥狂！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a peeping Tom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.14,0:42:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.24,0:42:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, wait a minute. Wait a minute. Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.03,0:42:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯塔拉！我的车又撞倒了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stella! Another one of these damn kids{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.95,0:42:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个呆小子！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}jumped in front of my car!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.33,0:42:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来帮忙把他抬到房子里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on out here! Help me take him in the house!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.55,0:42:35.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 是你吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom? That you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.05,0:42:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你醒了 放松点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There, there, now. Just relax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.72,0:42:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你几乎睡了9个小时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been asleep for almost nine hours now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.60,0:42:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是场恶梦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a horrible nightmare.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.10,0:42:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,还好及时回来了 真可怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I dreamed that I went back in time. It was terrible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.90,0:42:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.65,0:43:01.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎回到美好的1955年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're safe and sound now, back in good old 1955.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.20,0:43:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,1955年？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}1955?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.41,0:43:11.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我妈妈 你是我妈妈！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're my… You're my…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.29,0:43:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我名叫洛莲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Lorraine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.92,0:43:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛莲·贝恩斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lorraine Baines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.17,0:43:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.38,0:43:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你…你真是太…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're… You're so…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.59,0:43:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,太苗条了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're so thin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.01,0:43:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松 卡尔文 你的头撞伤了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just relax, Calvin. You got a big bruise on your head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.56,0:43:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我裤子呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are my pants?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.65,0:43:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那 在我的衣箱上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over there, on my hope chest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.61,0:43:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还没见过紫色的内裤 卡尔文{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never seen purple underwear before, Calvin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.03,0:43:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔文？为什么你一直叫我卡尔文？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calvin? Why do you keep calling me Calvin?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.91,0:43:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是你的名字吗？卡尔文·克雷恩？（内裤品牌名）{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that is your name, isn't it? Calvin Klein?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.37,0:43:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你内裤上写得到处都是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's written all over your underwear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.42,0:43:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家是不是叫你 卡尔？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I guess they call you Cal, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.17,0:43:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 实际上 大家叫我马丁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, actually, people call me Marty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.97,0:44:02.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你 卡尔文…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pleased to meet you, Calvin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.30,0:44:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.10,0:44:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,克雷恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Klein.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.11,0:44:16.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你介意我坐在这吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you mind if I sit here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.23,0:44:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.53,0:44:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 很好 很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Good. Fine. Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.90,0:44:24.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的伤口不小呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a big bruise you have there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.83,0:44:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛莲 亲爱的你还好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lorraine, are you up there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.24,0:44:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝 我妈妈！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God! It's my mother!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.33,0:44:33.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,快穿上你的牛仔裤！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quick! Put your pants back on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.55,0:44:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁 你来这多久了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, tell me, Marty, how long have you been in port?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.43,0:44:45.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.51,0:44:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,看你穿着救生衣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guessed you're a sailor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.60,0:44:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,准是个水手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why you wear that life preserver.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.85,0:44:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,是海岸防卫队吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coast Guard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.43,0:44:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,山姆 他就是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, here's the young man{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.44,0:44:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你撞到的那个年轻人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you hit with your car out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.94,0:44:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很好 感谢上帝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's all right. Thank God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.10,0:44:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这年纪在路中间干什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What were you doing in the middle of the street, a kid your age?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.40,0:44:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,别太在意 他心情不好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't pay attention to him. He's in one of his moods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.40,0:45:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,山姆 别弄那东西了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, you quit fiddling with that thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.07,0:45:02.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来吃晚餐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in here to dinner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.57,0:45:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来介绍 你已见过洛莲了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, let's see. You already know Lorraine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.66,0:45:08.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是内利森 这是萨利 那是托比{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Milton, this is Sally, that's Toby, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.58,0:45:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,在娃娃床里的是乔伊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and over there in the playpen is little baby Joey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.46,0:45:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来你就是我的乔伊舅舅{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you're my uncle Joey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.33,0:45:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这铁窗你最好习惯点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better get used to these bars, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.80,0:45:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是呀！乔伊就是喜欢呆在娃娃床里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Joey just loves being in his playpen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.38,0:45:24.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要把他带出来他就哭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He cries whenever we take him out, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.80,0:45:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们整天都把他放在里面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so we just leave him in there all the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.89,0:45:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁 但愿你喜欢吃肉丸子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Marty, I hope you like meatloaf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.18,0:45:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 我只是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I really ought to…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.47,0:45:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐这 马丁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit here, Marty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.27,0:45:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,山姆 别弄那东西了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, stop fiddling with that thing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.23,0:45:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来吃晚餐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and come in here and eat your dinner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.48,0:45:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,看那！可以用了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at it roll.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.32,0:45:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以一边吃饭一边看电视了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we can watch Jackie Gleason while we eat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.33,0:45:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们家的第一台电视机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's our first television set.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.21,0:45:55.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸今天挑的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad just picked it up today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.71,0:45:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有电视机吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have a television?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.88,0:46:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 我们家有两台{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, yeah. You know we have two of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.84,0:46:04.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定很有钱！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow! You must be rich.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.72,0:46:06.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 他是逗你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, honey, he's teasing you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.34,0:46:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人有两台电视机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody has two television sets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.85,0:46:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个我看过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Hey, I've seen this one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.23,0:46:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看过！这是个老家节目了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen this one! This is a classic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.73,0:46:21.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个人穿得像个太空人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where Ralph dresses up as a man from space.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.11,0:46:24.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,「看过」是什么意思？这可是最新的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, you've seen this? It's brand-new.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.61,0:46:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾经看过…它的重播{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, I saw it on a rerun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.70,0:46:29.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么是「重播」？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's a rerun?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.57,0:46:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会知道的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll find out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.20,0:46:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 马丁 你看起来很面熟 我认识你的母亲吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Marty, you look so familiar to me. Do I know your mother?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.79,0:46:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我想你认识{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I think maybe you do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.92,0:46:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我想给她打个电话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, then I want to give her a call.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.59,0:46:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想让她担心你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want her to worry about you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.34,0:46:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.59,0:46:47.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在家里没人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is, nobody's home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.64,0:46:51.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.02,0:46:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道河滨路在哪吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, do you know where Riverside Drive is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.98,0:46:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,在小镇另一边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's on the other end of town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.56,0:47:02.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅伯路的后面 小镇的东边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A block past Maple. East end of town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.19,0:47:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 梅伯路后面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute, a block past Maple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.15,0:47:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是约翰·肯尼迪路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's John F. Kennedy Drive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.03,0:47:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁是约翰·肯尼迪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell is John F. Kennedy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.11,0:47:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mother?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.03,0:47:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许马丁的父母出镇去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}With Marty's parents out of town, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.20,0:47:16.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不认为该留他过夜吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't you think he ought to spend the night?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.70,0:47:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕竟 爸爸差点把他撞死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, after all, Dad almost killed him with the car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.33,0:47:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那倒是 马丁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's true, Marty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.38,0:47:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该留下来过夜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think maybe you should spend the night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.09,0:47:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们的责任{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you're our responsibility.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.71,0:47:26.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 不必了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gee, I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.42,0:47:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可以睡在我的房间里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he can sleep in my room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.88,0:47:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得走了 我得走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta go! I gotta go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.93,0:47:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你们 晚餐很不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks very much. It was wonderful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.43,0:47:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们人也不错 以后见 不会等太久的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were all great. See you all later. Much later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.23,0:47:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个奇怪的年轻人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a very strange young man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.11,0:47:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个白痴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's an idiot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.57,0:47:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,家庭教养有问题 他父母一定也是白痴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Comes from upbringing. His parents are probably idiots, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.65,0:47:50.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛莲 如果你有这样的孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lorraine, you ever have a kid{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.95,0:47:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就和你断绝关系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who acts that way, I'll disown you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.32,0:48:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.32,0:48:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't say a word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.16,0:48:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想知道你的名字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't wanna know your name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.33,0:48:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想知道你的任何东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to know anything about you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.58,0:48:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听着 博士 - 别说话！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Listen, Doc… - Quiet!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.41,0:48:41.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 博士 是我 马丁 - 什么也别说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Doc, it's me, Marty. - Don't tell me anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.00,0:48:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 博士 你要帮我… - 别说话！别说话！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Doc, you got to help… - Quiet. Quiet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.92,0:48:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要读出你的思想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to read your thoughts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.01,0:48:52.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从很远的地方来？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see now. You've come here from a great distance?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.68,0:48:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.88,0:48:55.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,别告诉我！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't tell me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.68,0:48:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要我订{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want me to buy a subscription{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.18,0:48:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,周六晚报{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the Saturday Evening Post.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.60,0:48:59.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.72,0:49:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说话！别说话！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a word. Not a word now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.27,0:49:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,安静{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quiet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.60,0:49:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是捐款 你要我捐款{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Donations. You want me to make a donation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.27,0:49:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,给海岸防卫队的补给舰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the Coast Guard Youth Auxiliary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.11,0:49:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.03,0:49:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来自未来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm from the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.24,0:49:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我乘坐你发明的时间机器来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came here in a time machine that you invented.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.74,0:49:24.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你帮助我回到1985年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I need your help to get back to the year 1985.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.92,0:49:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.92,0:49:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这意味着什么吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know what this means?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.80,0:49:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这意味着这狗东西 一点用也没有！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means that this damn thing doesn't work at all!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.22,0:49:42.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得帮助我 你是唯一{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc, you got to help me. You are the only one{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.22,0:49:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道时间机器如何工作的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who knows how your time machine works.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.64,0:49:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间机器 我可没发明过什么时间机器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time machine? I haven't invented any time machine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.40,0:49:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我证明给你看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. All right, I'll prove it to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.90,0:49:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的驾照 1987年到期{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at my driver's license. Expires 1987.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.16,0:49:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,看我的生日 会令你大吃一惊！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at my birthday, for crying out loud!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.74,0:49:59.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还没出生呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't even been born yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.83,0:50:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这照片{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And look at this picture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.24,0:50:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我哥哥 我姐姐 还有我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my brother, my sister and me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.33,0:50:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,看运动衫 1984年的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at her sweatshirt, Doc."Class of 1984"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.58,0:50:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这照片真糟糕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty mediocre photographic fakery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.67,0:50:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你哥哥的脑袋被截去了一半{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They cut off your brother's hair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.46,0:50:15.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的是实话 博士 你得相信我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telling the truth, Doc. You got to believe me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.93,0:50:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那告诉我 你这未来小子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then tell me, future boy, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.18,0:50:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,1985年美国总统是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's President of the United States in 1985?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.35,0:50:24.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛伦·里根（曾经当过演员）{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ronald Reagan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.48,0:50:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛伦·里根 那个三流演员？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ronald Reagan? The actor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.44,0:50:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那副总统是谁？杰瑞·李维斯吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then who's vice president? Jerry Lewis?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.15,0:50:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮·怀曼 是第一夫人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose Jane Wyman is the First Lady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.61,0:50:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 博士！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa. Wait, Doc!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.78,0:50:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰德·克班尼 就是财政部部长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Jack Benny is secretary of the treasury.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.07,0:50:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士 你得听我说！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc, you gotta listen to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.57,0:50:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我今天够忙的了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've had enough practical jokes for one evening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.74,0:50:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 祝你好运 未来小子！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night, future boy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.99,0:50:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, wait, Doc. Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.45,0:50:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,撞伤 你头部的撞伤 我知道是怎么回事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bruise on your head, I know how that happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.33,0:50:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你全告诉了我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You told me the whole story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.83,0:50:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你站在马桶上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were standing on your toilet{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.38,0:50:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备挂钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you were hanging a clock, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.50,0:50:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你滑倒了 撞在水池上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you fell and you hit your head on the sink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.80,0:50:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个念头忽现：通量电容器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's when you came up with the idea for the flux capacitor, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.80,0:51:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是它 使时间旅行成为可能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is what makes time travel possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.90,0:51:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,它发动不起来 所以我把它藏在这{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something wrong with the starter, so I hid it here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.58,0:51:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,在厕所摔倒之后 我画了这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}After I fell off my toilet, I drew this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.92,0:51:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,通量电容器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The flux capacitor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.57,0:51:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,成功了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It works!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.40,0:52:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,成功了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It works!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.24,0:52:05.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我终于发明了能用的东西！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I finally invent something that works!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.70,0:52:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,它当然可以用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bet your ass it works.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.75,0:52:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得把它偷偷弄回实验室{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somehow we've got to sneak this back to my laboratory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.88,0:52:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们着手把你送回家吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got to get you home!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.46,0:52:17.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士 就是这{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Doc, this is it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.05,0:52:21.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管了 不管了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never mind that. Never mind that now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.22,0:52:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,看呀！是我！我变成老头了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, that's me! Look at me! I'm an old man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.72,0:52:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上好 我是 埃米特·布朗博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening. I'm Dr. Emmett Brown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.06,0:52:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正站在双松购物超市停车场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm standing on the parking lot at Twin Pines Mall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.22,0:52:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢上帝 我还有头发{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank God, I've still got my hair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.31,0:52:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我穿着什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's on Earth is this thing I'm wearing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.39,0:52:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是防辐射衣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a radiation suit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.65,0:52:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,防辐射衣？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Radiation suit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.48,0:52:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊！就跟原子沉落一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course. 'Cause of all the fallout from the atomic wars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.82,0:52:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这 真是了不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is truly amazing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.99,0:52:46.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个手提电视摄像机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A portable television studio.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.91,0:52:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,难怪你们的总统是个演员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No wonder your president has to be an actor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.49,0:52:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他在电视上好看些{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gotta look good on television.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.75,0:52:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,到了 就是这部分{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa. This is it. This is the part coming up, Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.92,0:52:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这依靠电能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, this sucker's electrical, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.46,0:52:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有核反应{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I need a nuclear reaction{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.59,0:52:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,才能产生所需的 1.21 兆瓦电能…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to generate the 1.21 gigawatts…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.46,0:53:00.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在说什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did I just say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.26,0:53:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这依靠电能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This sucker's electrical, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.43,0:53:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有核反应{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I need a nuclear reaction{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.64,0:53:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,才能产生所需的 1.21 兆瓦电能…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to generate the 1.21 gigawatts…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.43,0:53:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,1.21 兆瓦！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}1.21 gigawatts!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.27,0:53:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,1.21 兆瓦！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}1.21 gigawatts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.48,0:53:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great Scott!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.28,0:53:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,「兆瓦特」是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is a gigawatt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.49,0:53:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么会如此随便？1.21 兆瓦是多少啊？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could I have been so careless? 1.21 gigawatts!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.66,0:53:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么弄到如此巨大的能量？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tom, how am I going to generate that kind of power?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.45,0:53:32.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,办不到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can't be done, can it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.16,0:53:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士 博士 我们只需要一点点钚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc, look. All we need is a little plutonium.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.13,0:53:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 在1985年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure that in 1985, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.96,0:53:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个药品商店里都能买到钚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}plutonium is available in every corner drugstore, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.21,0:53:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,但在1955年 就很难弄到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but in 1955, it's a little hard to come by.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.05,0:53:46.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁 我很抱歉 你被困在这了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marty, I'm sorry, but I'm afraid you're stuck here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.72,0:53:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能被困在这 我的生活在1985年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc, stuck here? I can't be stuck here. I got a life in 1985.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.22,0:53:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还有个女朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.39,0:53:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,她漂亮吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is she pretty?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.98,0:53:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,她非常漂亮 非常爱我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc, she's beautiful. She's crazy about me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.02,0:54:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这个 看她在这写的 博士 这说明了一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this. Look what she wrote here, Doc. I mean, that says it all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.57,0:54:07.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士 你是我的唯一希望{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc, you're my only hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.82,0:54:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁 对不起 产生1.21兆瓦电能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marty, I'm sorry, but the only power source capable of generating{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.24,0:54:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,的唯一方法 只有闪电{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}1.21 gigawatts of electricity is a bolt of lightning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.87,0:54:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.08,0:54:18.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪电{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A bolt of lightning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.33,0:54:19.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不幸的是 你无法知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unfortunately, you never know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.42,0:54:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,何时何地会出现闪电{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}when or where it's ever going to strike.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.05,0:54:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们知道了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.51,0:54:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是它！这就是答案{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it! This is the answer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.85,0:54:37.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里写着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It says here that a bolt of lightning{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.35,0:54:38.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪电在晚上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is going to strike the clock tower{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.44,0:54:41.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,10：04 击中钟楼 就在下周六晚上！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}at precisely 10:04 p.m. Next Saturday night!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.24,0:54:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果能设法将闪电{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we could somehow harness this lightning, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.87,0:54:53.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,导入通量电容器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}channel it into the flux capacitor, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.41,0:54:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能使它运作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it just might work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.50,0:55:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,下周六晚我们就能送你回到未来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next Saturday night, we're sending you back to the future!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.71,0:55:03.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,下周六 好极了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, all right. Saturday's good. Saturday's good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.67,0:55:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得在1955年呆上一周了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can spend a week in 1955.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.55,0:55:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你带我到处走走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can hang out. You can show me around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.38,0:55:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁 不行！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marty, that is completely out of the question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.30,0:55:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须呆在房子里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must not leave this house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.72,0:55:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能见任何人 与任何人说话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must not see anybody or talk to anybody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.81,0:55:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你所做的会对未来有严重影响{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything you do can have serious repercussions on future events.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.47,0:55:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.10,0:55:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了 知道了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Sure. Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.69,0:55:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marty, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.31,0:55:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,除我之外 你今天没碰到别人吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}have you interacted with anybody else today, besides me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.57,0:55:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我可能碰到了我的父母{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, I might've sort of bumped into my parents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.78,0:55:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great Scott!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.41,0:55:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,再看看照片上你的哥哥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me see that photograph again of your brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.08,0:55:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,正像我说的那样 这验证了我的理论 看你的哥哥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just as I thought. This proves my theory. Look at your brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.75,0:55:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊！他的头像被擦掉了一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His head's gone. It's like it's been erased.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.63,0:55:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,擦掉他的存在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Erased from existence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.43,0:55:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方扫过之后 就像新的一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They really cleaned this place up. Looks brand-new.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.27,0:55:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now remember.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.35,0:56:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据我的理论 你干预了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to my theory, you interfered{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.69,0:56:01.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父母的初次相遇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with your parents' first meeting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.94,0:56:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有相遇 他们就不会相爱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they don't meet, they won't fall in love, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.27,0:56:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,就不会结婚 也就没有孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}they won't get married and they won't have kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.15,0:56:06.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此 你哥哥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why your older brother's{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.28,0:56:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,从照片上消失了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}disappearing from that photograph.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.61,0:56:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你姐姐是下一个 除非你想办法改变{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your sister will follow, and unless you repair the damage, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.90,0:56:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则下一个就是你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll be next.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.20,0:56:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听起来非常「严重」（很重） - 「很重」？重量跟这件事无关{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sounds pretty heavy. - Weight has nothing to do with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.24,0:56:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪个是你父亲？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which one's your pop?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.29,0:56:18.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.08,0:56:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 好 伙计们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Okay, you guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.13,0:56:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这很有趣 你们真成熟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very funny. You guys are being real mature.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.46,0:56:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你是被他领养的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you were adopted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.42,0:56:30.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们真成熟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, real mature, guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.88,0:56:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,捡起我的书{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, pick up my books.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.34,0:56:34.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦佛莱！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}McFly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.47,0:56:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 斯特里克兰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Strickland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.64,0:56:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天 那家伙长过头发没有？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, didn't that guy ever have hair?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.81,0:56:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个懒散的家伙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shape up, man. You're a slacker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.64,0:56:44.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算这辈子都这样懒散下去吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want to be a slacker for the rest of your life?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.81,0:56:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.23,0:56:47.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈妈怎么会看上这样的家伙？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did your mother ever see in that kid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.86,0:56:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.23,0:56:50.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜我妈妈是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess she felt sorry for him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.03,0:56:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,为外公撞倒他而感到抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause her dad hit him with the car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.66,0:56:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,可现在车子撞倒的是我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hit me with the car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.99,0:56:57.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是 法伦·史戴伦 效应{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the Florence Nightingale effect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.08,0:57:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,医院的护士会爱上病人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It happens in hospitals when nurses fall in love with their patients.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.50,0:57:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧 孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to it, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.58,0:57:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔治 老兄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, George, buddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.00,0:57:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在找你呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have been looking all over for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.46,0:57:12.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,还记得我吗？我救了你命的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember me, the guy who saved your life the other day?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.68,0:57:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当然 - 很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.76,0:57:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让你见个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's somebody I'd like you to meet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.18,0:57:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛莲？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lorraine?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.85,0:57:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔文！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calvin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.44,0:57:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,见见我的好友 乔治·麦佛莱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like you to meet my good friend George McFly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.27,0:57:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 很高兴认识你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. It's really a pleasure to meet you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.69,0:57:33.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的头怎样了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's your head?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.82,0:57:35.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.24,0:57:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚你离开之后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. I've been so worried about you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.20,0:57:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直为你担心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}ever since you ran off the other night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.16,0:57:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还好吗？- 没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you okay? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.87,0:57:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉我得走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I have to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.21,0:57:44.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,走啦！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.29,0:57:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他真是个白马王子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't he a dreamboat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.26,0:57:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士 她对他不屑一顾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc, she didn't even look at him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.92,0:57:54.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,很糟糕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is more serious than I thought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.55,0:57:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然 你母亲迷上了你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently, your mother is amorously infatuated with you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.59,0:57:58.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是你父亲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}instead of your father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.85,0:57:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa. Wait a minute, Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.06,0:58:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说我妈妈喜欢上我了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you trying to tell me that my mother has got the hots for me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.81,0:58:04.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,正是！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Precisely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.02,0:58:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢…「严重」了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa. This is heavy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.65,0:58:08.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又说那个字眼：「很重」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's that word again."Heavy."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.81,0:58:10.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么每件事都「很重」？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are things so heavy in the future?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.23,0:58:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是未来的地心引力出了问题？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there a problem with the Earth's gravitational pull?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.40,0:58:14.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一让他们结婚的办法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? The only way we're going to get those two to successfully mate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.07,0:58:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,是让他们独处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is if they're alone together, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.53,0:58:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们多交流{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you've got to get your father and mother to interact{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.24,0:58:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,通过某些社交活动…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in some sort of social…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.66,0:58:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你意思是 一个约会？- 对！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? You mean like a date? - Right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.41,0:58:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么样的约会？- 我可不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What kind of date? - I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.58,0:58:28.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,50年代的孩子都干些什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do kids do in the '50s?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.21,0:58:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是你的父母 你该知道的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're your parents. You must know them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.09,0:58:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的共同兴趣是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are their common interests?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.30,0:58:34.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,喜欢一起做什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do they like to do together?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.26,0:58:36.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.43,0:58:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,看！有个舞会要来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look! There's a rhythmic ceremonial ritual coming up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.72,0:58:41.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错！就是「海中魅力舞会」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course! The Enchantment Under the Sea dance!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.76,0:58:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在那里约会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're supposed to go to this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.22,0:58:44.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那第一次接吻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's where they kiss for the first time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.06,0:58:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.52,0:58:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好看着你父亲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stick to your father like glue{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.19,0:58:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定要把他带到舞会上去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and make sure he takes her to that dance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.44,0:58:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔治 老兄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}George, buddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.77,0:58:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得我给你介绍的那个女孩吗？洛莲？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember that girl I introduced you to, Lorraine?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.08,0:59:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在写什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you writing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.79,0:59:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦…小说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh… Stories.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.62,0:59:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,是关于…天外来客{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Science fiction stories about visitors{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.63,0:59:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,从另一个行星来到地球{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}coming down to Earth from other planets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.92,0:59:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,少来了 我不知道 你还有这样的想象力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of town! I didn't know you did anything creative.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.09,0:59:21.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我看看？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me read some.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.30,0:59:22.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 不 不 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. No, no, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.97,0:59:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从不让别人看我的小说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never let anybody read my stories.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.56,0:59:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.23,0:59:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们不喜欢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what if they didn't like them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.19,0:59:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们说我很糟？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if they told me I was no good?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.73,0:59:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这很难让人理解的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess that would be pretty hard for somebody to understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.99,0:59:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不…一点也不难{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, not hard at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.78,0:59:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎样 乔治 关于洛莲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, anyway, George. About Lorraine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.50,0:59:48.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很喜欢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She really likes you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.29,0:59:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,她要我告诉你 要你邀请她去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She told me to tell you that she wants you to ask her{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.33,0:59:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,「海中魅力舞会」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the Enchantment Under the Sea dance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.17,0:59:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的？- 是的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Really? - Oh, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.42,0:59:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只过去去邀请她就行了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you got to do is go over there and ask her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.42,1:00:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？就在这餐厅里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Right here, right now, in the cafeteria?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.68,1:00:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是她不答应呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if she said no?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.84,1:00:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 是否受得了这样的拒绝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know if I could take that kind of a rejection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.10,1:00:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且 我想她宁愿另一个人去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, I think she'd rather go with somebody else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.35,1:00:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.32,1:00:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Biff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.99,1:00:19.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲热一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't kid around. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.29,1:00:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想干什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.53,1:00:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 你喜欢这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want it. You know you want it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.49,1:00:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know you want me to give it to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.70,1:00:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,住嘴！我才不是那种女孩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut your filthy mouth. I'm not that kind of girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.54,1:00:31.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是的 只不过你还不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you are and you just don't know it yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.37,1:00:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开我！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your meat hooks off of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.29,1:00:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.42,1:00:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,她要你放开她！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She said, get your meat hooks off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.21,1:00:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,请{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.30,1:00:43.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,关你什么事 呆小子！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what's it to you, butthead?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.51,1:00:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这是欠揍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you been looking for a fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.69,1:01:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,看在你是新来的份上 我放过你 只是今天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since you're new here, I'm going to cut you a break, today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.57,1:01:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在给我从这里滚出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, why don't you make like a tree and get out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.05,1:01:20.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔治！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}George!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.59,1:01:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你老跟着我？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you keep following me around?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.72,1:01:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 乔治！… 我在和你说话呢！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, George… I'm telling you, George, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.76,1:01:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不邀请洛莲去跳舞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you do not ask Lorraine to that dance, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.60,1:01:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会后悔一辈子的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna regret it for the rest of my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.18,1:01:31.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我不能去跳舞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can't go to the dance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.73,1:01:34.85,Title,0,0,0,0,,那会错过我最喜欢的电视节目《科幻小说剧场》{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll miss my favorite television program, Science Fiction Theatre.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.94,1:01:38.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,但 乔治…洛莲想要和你一起去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but, George, Lorraine wants to go with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.40,1:01:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,给她一次机会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give her a break.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.61,1:01:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可没打算和洛莲跳舞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm just not ready to ask Lorraine out to the dance, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.57,1:01:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你们每个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and not you or anybody else on this planet{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.87,1:01:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,都想要改变我的意愿呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is going to make me change my mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.25,1:01:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,科幻小说剧场？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Science Fiction Theatre.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.02,1:02:10.10,Note,0,0,0,0,,（科幻小说）
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.40,1:02:18.55,Note,0,0,0,0,,（前卫音乐）
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.83,1:02:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.46,1:02:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说话 地球人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Silence, Earthling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.96,1:02:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我名叫达斯·维达（星球大战人物）{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Darth Vader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.47,1:02:51.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是飞鹰星来的外星人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am an extraterrestrial from the planet Vulcan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.02,1:02:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marty!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.35,1:02:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁！马丁！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marty! Marty!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.52,1:03:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔治{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, George, buddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.69,1:03:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没上学？这一整天你做什么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You weren't at school. What have you been doing all day?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.15,1:03:06.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我睡过头了 我需要你的帮助{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I overslept. Look, I need your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.15,1:03:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须邀请洛莲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to ask Lorraine out, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.70,1:03:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我不知道该怎么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I don't know how to do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.86,1:03:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 喘口气 她在咖啡店里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Okay, listen, keep your pants on. She's over in the cafe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.78,1:03:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}God! How do you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.91,1:03:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么改变主意了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What made you change your mind, George?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.46,1:03:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚 从飞鹰星来了个外星人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last night, Darth Vader came down from Planet Vulcan{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.46,1:03:25.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他告诉我 如果我不邀请洛莲 他就熔化我的脑袋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and told me that if I didn't take Lorraine out, that he'd melt my brain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.46,1:03:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们保守这个秘密 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just keep this brain-melting stuff to ourselves, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.63,1:03:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.84,1:03:32.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 好 她在那 乔治{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, okay. There she is, George.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.22,1:03:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去 邀请她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now just go in there and invite her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.06,1:03:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我不知道该说些什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. But I don't know what to say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.72,1:03:36.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,说什么都行 乔治{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just say anything, George.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.89,1:03:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,自然点儿 说你想到的第一句话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say whatever's natural, the first thing that comes into your mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.56,1:03:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我脑子里空空如也{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing's coming to my mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.57,1:03:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 我怎么会出生的啊？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, George, it's a wonder I was even born.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.36,1:03:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.40,1:03:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么…没什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing. Nothing. Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.49,1:03:52.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如 跟她说 是命运让你们相遇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, tell her destiny brought you together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.66,1:03:54.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是你所见过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell her that she is the most beautiful girl{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.66,1:03:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,最美丽的女孩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you have ever seen in the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.58,1:03:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,女孩总喜欢这样的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Girls like that stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.91,1:03:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing, George?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.00,1:04:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要记下来 这些话很不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm writing this down. This is good stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.88,1:04:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Okay, let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.46,1:04:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 整整头发 - 我准备好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can you take care of that? - Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.44,1:04:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我一杯牛奶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lou, give me a milk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.73,1:04:29.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,加巧克力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chocolate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.29,1:04:50.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛莲 命运将我带给了你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lorraine. My density has popped me to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.76,1:04:52.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.05,1:04:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 我意思是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I meant to say was…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.81,1:05:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一等 我见过你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute. Don't I know you from somewhere?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.31,1:05:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.73,1:05:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我是乔治 乔治·麦佛莱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. I'm George. George McFly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.27,1:05:08.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是你的「密度」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm your density.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.94,1:05:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.65,1:05:14.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是你的命运{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}your destiny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.08,1:05:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 麦佛莱！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, McFly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.87,1:05:21.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.91,1:05:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉过你 别到这来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I told you never to come in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.34,1:05:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁花你的钱？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's going to cost you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.92,1:05:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你身上有多少钱？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much money you got on you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.51,1:05:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要多少 贝夫？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much do you want, Biff?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.85,1:05:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 呆子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, punk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.52,1:05:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 我要…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I'm going to…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.61,1:05:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝夫 那是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa, Biff. What's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.99,1:05:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 卡尔文·克雷恩 噢 我的天 真像梦一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Calvin Klein. Oh, my God, he's a dream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.33,1:06:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子 停下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kid! Kid, stop! Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.20,1:06:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.54,1:06:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,待会还你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get it back to you, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.67,1:06:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你弄坏了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You broke it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.71,1:06:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,回来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come back here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.01,1:06:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,看他！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. Look at him go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.63,1:06:16.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住他！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.23,1:06:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,快追车！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the car! Go! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.70,1:06:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在什么东西上面？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that thing he's on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.03,1:06:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,一块有轮子的板{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a board with wheels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.58,1:06:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他真是白马王子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's an absolute dream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.24,1:06:44.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.54,1:06:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,追上那辆车！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out for the car!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.41,1:07:21.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要宰了他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to ram him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.62,1:07:29.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.63,1:07:42.40,Note,0,0,0,0,,（肥料车）
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.02,1:07:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks a lot, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.86,1:08:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要找那狗娘养的算帐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to get that son of a bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.36,1:08:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他从哪来？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where does he come from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.49,1:08:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 他住在哪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, where does he live?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.08,1:08:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 但我会找出来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, but I'm going to find out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.50,1:08:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.25,1:08:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是怎么找到我的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They found me. I don't know how, but they found me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.42,1:08:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁 快跑！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run for it, Marty!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.80,1:08:26.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.97,1:08:29.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是怎么找到我的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They found me. I don't know how, but they found me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.98,1:08:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁 快跑！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run for it, Marty!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.65,1:08:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.48,1:08:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 马丁 我没听到你进来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Marty. I didn't hear you come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.40,1:08:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,很有趣的机器…录像机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fascinating device, this video unit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.95,1:08:43.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.70,1:08:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些事情要告诉你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, there's something{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.74,1:08:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于那晚…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't told you about the night{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.03,1:08:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们拍的录像 - 马丁 别告诉我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- we made that tape. - Please, Marty, don't tell me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.41,1:08:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于我命运的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No man should know too much about his own destiny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.79,1:08:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不明白 - 我当然明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You don't understand. - I do understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.25,1:08:51.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,对自己的命运知道太多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I know too much about my own future, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.54,1:08:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就不会为生存而努力了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can endanger my own existence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.04,1:08:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像你和大自然斗争一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just as you've endangered yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.34,1:08:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right. Now…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.34,1:09:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你看看送你回家的计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me show you my plan for sending you home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.30,1:09:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 这模型有点粗糙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please excuse the crudity of this model.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.14,1:09:06.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没时间做精确比例 上颜色{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't have time to build it to scale or paint it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.55,1:09:08.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很不错 - 谢谢 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's good. - Thank you. Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.77,1:09:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 现在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.06,1:09:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们使用工业电线{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We run some industrial-strength electrical cable{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.35,1:09:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,从钟楼的顶部{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}from the top of the clock tower{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.27,1:09:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,牵到街上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}down, suspending it over the street{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.98,1:09:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,两灯柱之间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}between these two lamp posts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.19,1:09:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,同时 我们把时间机器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meanwhile, we've outfitted the time vehicle{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.74,1:09:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这的竿子 和钩子连接{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with this big pole and hook, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.28,1:09:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,直达通量电容器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}which runs directly into the flux capacitor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.16,1:09:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,在计算好的时间 你从街头出发{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the calculated moment, you start off from down the street, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.91,1:09:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,驶向电线{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}driving directly toward the cable, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.25,1:09:36.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,加速至时速 88 英里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}accelerating to 88 miles per hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.50,1:09:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,据传单上说 本周六晚 10：04{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to the flyer, at precisely 10:04 p.m. This Saturday night, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.96,1:09:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪电将准时击中钟楼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}lightning will strike the clock tower, electrifying the cable{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.68,1:09:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,电线正好在那时与钩子接触{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}just as the connecting hook makes contact{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.01,1:09:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,将 1.21 兆瓦电力导入通量电容器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}thereby sending 1.21 gigawatts into the flux capacitor{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.01,1:09:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你送回1985年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and sending you back to 1985.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.27,1:09:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 看好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, now. Watch this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.39,1:09:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把这小车上紧然后放手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wind up the car and release it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.11,1:10:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我模拟闪电{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll simulate the lightning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.62,1:10:09.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.54,1:10:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Set.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.72,1:10:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,放手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Release.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.36,1:10:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚才不是很有信心吗 博士？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're instilling me with a lot of confidence, Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.61,1:10:48.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 这个我来处理{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry. I'll take care of the lightning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.07,1:10:51.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你注意好你的父亲就是了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take care of your pop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.83,1:10:55.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 今天进展如何？他约她出去了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way, what happened today? Did he ask her out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.91,1:10:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.12,1:10:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说什么了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did she say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.84,1:11:08.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你母亲 她找到你了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your mom! She's tracked you down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.68,1:11:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,把车盖好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quick! Let's cover the time machine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.28,1:11:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 马丁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Cal… Marty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.24,1:11:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈…洛莲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom. Lorraine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.20,1:11:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道我在这？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you know I was here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.33,1:11:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟踪你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I followed you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.70,1:11:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的博士…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. This is my doc…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.79,1:11:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叔叔 布朗博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My uncle, Doc Brown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.21,1:11:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 - 嗨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi. - Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.55,1:11:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁 我知道这有点早{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marty, this may seem a little forward, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.09,1:11:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想 你是否会邀请我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I was kind of wondering if you'd ask me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.39,1:11:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,参加星期六的「魅力海洋舞会」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the Enchantment Under the Sea dance on Saturday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.90,1:12:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说 还没人邀请你吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, you mean… You mean nobody's asked you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.77,1:12:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 还没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Not yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.57,1:12:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那乔治呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about George?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.20,1:12:12.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔治·麦佛莱？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}George McFly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.54,1:12:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很可爱 但你知道…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's kind of cute and all, but not…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.42,1:12:24.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要的是强壮的男人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I think a man should be strong, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.46,1:12:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,能靠自己站起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so he can stand up for himself{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.76,1:12:32.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,去保护他心爱的女人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and protect the woman he loves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.72,1:12:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.60,1:12:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.14,1:12:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是不明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still don't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.60,1:12:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么和她去跳舞呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How am I supposed to go to the dance with her{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.40,1:12:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不是要和你跳吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}if she's already going to the dance with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.24,1:12:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为 乔治 她想和你一起去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, because, George, she wants to go with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.99,1:12:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是她自己还不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She just doesn't know it yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.99,1:12:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 我们要让她知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why we got to show her{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.07,1:12:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 乔治·麦佛莱 是个勇士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you, George McFly, are a fighter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.12,1:12:59.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个能自己站起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're somebody who's gonna stand up for yourself, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.12,1:13:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且能保护她的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}somebody who's gonna protect her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.66,1:13:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我这辈子还没打过架呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but I've never picked a fight in my entire life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.96,1:13:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是去打架 爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you're not going to be picking a fight, Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.79,1:13:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸…老兄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy-o.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.09,1:13:11.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是去拯救她 不是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're coming to her rescue, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.47,1:13:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 再重复一次我的计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, let's go over the plan again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.72,1:13:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,8：55 你去哪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}8:55, where are you going to be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.55,1:13:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去舞会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to be at the dance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.22,1:13:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么我去哪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. And where am I going to be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.35,1:13:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和她一起呆在车里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna be in the car with her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.43,1:13:20.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 9：00{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, okay. So, right around 9:00, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.98,1:13:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,她就会对我感到恼火{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}she's going to get very angry with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.48,1:13:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么她会恼火？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is she going to get angry with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.98,1:13:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为 乔治 当男孩占她们便宜的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, because, George, nice girls get angry{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.40,1:13:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好女孩 总是会生气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}when guys take advantage of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.90,1:13:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你意思是 你要碰她…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean you're going to go touch her on her…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.99,1:13:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 乔治{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, George, look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.28,1:13:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是表演 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just an act, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.54,1:13:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 9：00 你就到停车场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. So, 9:00, you're strolling through the parking lot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.46,1:13:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会看到车里有争斗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see us struggling in the car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.09,1:13:50.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你走过来 拉开车门 说…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You walk up, you open the door, and you say…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.88,1:13:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的台词 乔治{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your line, George.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.76,1:13:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你！把那该死的手从她身上拿开！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you, get your damn hands off her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.93,1:14:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须诅咒吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really think I ought to swear?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.35,1:14:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 干脆点！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, definitely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.44,1:14:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的 诅咒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}God damn it, George, swear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.15,1:14:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好！你走过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. So, now you come up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.23,1:14:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,揍我的肚子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You punch me in the stomach.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.44,1:14:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我逃了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm out for the count, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.32,1:14:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和洛莲 从此将幸福的生活在一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you and Lorraine live happily ever after.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.61,1:14:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说起来很简单{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You make it sound so easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.91,1:14:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只希望不会感到点怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just… I wish I wasn't so scared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.45,1:14:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔治 没什么好怕的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}George, there's nothing to be scared of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.79,1:14:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,只需要一点自信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All it takes is a little self-confidence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.41,1:14:26.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 「只要一心一意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, if you put your mind to it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.21,1:14:27.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,做什么都成「{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can accomplish anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.29,1:14:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,山谷镇周六晚天气预报{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Hill Valley area weather this Saturday night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.59,1:14:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,晴朗 有些许云彩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mostly clear, with some scattered clouds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.68,1:14:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,气温40度左右{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lows tonight in the upper 40s.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.47,1:14:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定暴风雨一定会来吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure about this storm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.22,1:14:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,别相信天气预报 更别提未来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since when can weathermen predict the weather, let alone the future?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.89,1:14:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁 看到你走 我很伤心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Marty, I'm going to be very sad to see you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.65,1:14:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你改变了我的生命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've really made a difference in my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.94,1:14:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,给了我奋斗的目标{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've given me something to shoot for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.15,1:14:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想看 我会活着看到1985年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just knowing that I'm going to be around to see 1985.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.40,1:14:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会成功的发明这个！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I'm going to succeed in this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.41,1:15:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我将有机会穿越时光！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I'm going to have a chance to travel through time!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.41,1:15:09.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,要经过30年漫长等待 我才能再和你谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's going to be really hard waiting 30 years before I can talk to you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.17,1:15:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这三天发生的事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}about everything that's happened in the past few days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.21,1:15:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会想念你的 马丁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm really going to miss you, Marty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.13,1:15:17.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm really going to miss you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.35,1:15:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士 关于未来…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc, about the future…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.60,1:15:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.35,1:15:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁 我们已经认同了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marty! We've already agreed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.77,1:15:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道未来的事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that having information about the future{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.15,1:15:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是相当危险的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}can be extremely dangerous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.69,1:15:32.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管你一片好心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if your intentions are good, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.27,1:15:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,但结果也许相反的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it can backfire drastically.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.48,1:15:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你所要告诉我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever you've got to tell me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.78,1:15:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会通过时间理解{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll find out through the natural course of time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.91,1:15:42.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,「亲爱的布朗博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Dear Dr. Brown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.62,1:15:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我回去的那晚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the night that I go back in time, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.54,1:15:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you will be{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.87,1:15:51.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,被恐怖分子枪杀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}shot by terrorists.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.29,1:15:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,请采取防范措施{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please take whatever precautions are necessary{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.84,1:15:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,防止这可怕的事情发生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to prevent this terrible disaster.{\r}
