Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.47,1:16:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁「{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marty."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.33,1:16:10.54,Note,0,0,0,0,,（请在 1985年开封）
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.15,1:16:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上好 布朗博士 这电线干什么用的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Evening, Dr. Brown. What's with the wire?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.19,1:16:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 只是个气象实验{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, just a little weather experiment.{\r}
