Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.03,1:16:22.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,别 别碰！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Don't touch that!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.11,1:16:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是非常敏感的气象传感器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some new, specialized weather-sensing equipment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.99,1:16:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有许可证吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a permit for that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.29,1:16:28.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.05,1:16:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一等 待我查看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a second. Let me see if I can find it here.{\r}
