Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.31,1:17:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你介不介意我们停车…亲热一阵？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you mind if we park for a while?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.11,1:17:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好主意 我喜欢在车里亲热{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a great idea. I'd love to park.{\r}
