Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.07,1:17:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我并不是从来没跟人在车里亲热过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not like I've never parked before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.78,1:17:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.62,1:17:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁 你很紧张 出什么事了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marty, you seem so nervous. Is something wrong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.70,1:17:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.75,1:18:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛莲 洛莲 你在干什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lorraine! Lorraine, what are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.63,1:18:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从老妈酒柜里弄到的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swiped it from the old lady's liquor cabinet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.05,1:18:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 你不能喝酒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, you shouldn't drink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.05,1:18:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.10,1:18:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.89,1:18:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,会为此后悔一辈子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might regret it later in life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.68,1:18:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这么保守！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marty, don't be such a square.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.69,1:18:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里人人都喝酒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody who's anybody drinks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.78,1:18:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 你还抽烟？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeez, you smoke, too?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.99,1:18:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开始像我妈妈了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marty, you're beginning to sound just like my mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.21,1:18:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,休息一会儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going to take a little break, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.63,1:18:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很快就回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we'll be back in a while, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.21,1:18:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家请别走开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so don't nobody go nowhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.19,1:19:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁？为什么你这么紧张？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marty? Why are you so nervous?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.74,1:19:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛莲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lorraine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.03,1:19:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是否遇到过这样的情况{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you ever been in a situation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.29,1:19:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要做一件事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}where you knew you had to act a certain way, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.16,1:19:17.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,当事到临头 却不知{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but when you got there, you didn't know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.42,1:19:19.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,如何是好？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you could go through with it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.25,1:19:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说 第一次约会不知该怎么做吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean like how you're supposed to act on a first date?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.80,1:19:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,也可以这么说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sort of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.84,1:19:27.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我很清楚你的意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I know exactly what you mean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.34,1:19:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.14,1:19:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那情况下我怎样做 你知道吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I do in those situations?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.85,1:19:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.06,1:19:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不担心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't worry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.12,1:19:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,全错了 我不知道为什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is all wrong. I don't know what it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.41,1:20:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我吻你 就像是在吻…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But when I kiss you, it's like I'm kissing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.67,1:20:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的弟弟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}my brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.34,1:20:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有任何感觉 对吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess that doesn't make any sense, does it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.13,1:20:12.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然有 感觉相当不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me, it makes perfect sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.97,1:20:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody's coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.60,1:20:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你害我花了300美元修车费 你这个狗娘养的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You caused 300 bucks damage to my car, you son of a bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.90,1:20:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要让你的屁股来偿还！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm going to take it out of your ass. Hold him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.11,1:20:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他走 贝夫 你醉了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let him go, Biff. You're drunk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.36,1:20:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧 谁在这啊？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, look-ey what we have here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.62,1:20:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,别走 到我这来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no! You're staying right here with me. Come on, Lorraine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.33,1:20:41.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开我！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.46,1:20:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开她 你这杂种！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave her alone, you bastard!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.79,1:20:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他带到后面去 我马上来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take him in back, all right? I'll be right there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.71,1:20:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,别害臊啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just admit that you want it. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.88,1:20:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去 有什么好看的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, go on. This ain't no peep show.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.93,1:20:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,有辆车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, let's put him in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.94,1:21:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是弄坏我头发的代价{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's for messing up my hair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.35,1:21:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在我车里干什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you doing to my car?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.52,1:21:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑鬼 这没你的事！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, beat it, spook. This don't concern you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.57,1:21:13.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,喊谁黑鬼呢 你这呆瓜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who you calling "spook, " peckerwood?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.62,1:21:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 听着 伙计…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, listen, guys…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.37,1:21:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 我可不想找麻烦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I don't want to mess with no reefer addicts, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.04,1:21:20.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,回去找你们的母亲去！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get home to your mama, boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.96,1:21:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝夫！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Biff!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.12,1:21:23.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 贝夫！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry, Biff!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.75,1:21:25.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,放我出去！救救我！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me out of here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.38,1:21:28.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的钥匙在哪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reginald, where are your keys?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.96,1:21:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,在行李箱里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The keys are in the trunk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.59,1:21:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说一遍？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say that again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.80,1:21:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说钥匙就在我这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said, the keys are in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.36,1:21:49.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,来嘛！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.74,1:21:54.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你！把那该死的手拿开！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you, get your damn hands off…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.70,1:22:00.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你弄错车子了吧 麦佛莱？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you got the wrong car, McFly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.62,1:22:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔治 救救我 求你了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}George, help me! Please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.75,1:22:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,转过身 然后走开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just turn around, McFly, and walk away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.67,1:22:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔治 救救我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, George.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.75,1:22:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你聋了吗 麦佛莱？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you deaf, McFly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.92,1:22:12.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,关上车门 转过身去！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Close the door and beat it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.59,1:22:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 贝夫！你放开她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Biff. You leave her alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.93,1:22:20.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 麦佛莱！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, McFly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.98,1:22:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可是你自找的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're asking for it, and now you're going to get it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.02,1:22:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝夫 住手！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Biff, stop it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.53,1:22:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要把他的手弄断了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Biff, you'll break his arm!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.28,1:22:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝夫 不！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Biff, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.36,1:22:39.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,来帮个忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a hand here, Reginald.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.99,1:22:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼 我的手刮伤了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it, man! I sliced my hand!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.37,1:22:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁的钥匙？- 我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Whose are these? - Mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.91,1:22:46.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks. Thanks a lot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.17,1:22:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要把他的手弄断了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to break his arm!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.71,1:22:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝夫 放开他！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Biff! Biff, leave him alone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.92,1:22:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他走吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let him go! Let him go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.54,1:23:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.19,1:23:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那家伙是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is that guy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.61,1:23:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔治·麦佛莱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's George McFly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.65,1:24:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个 乔治·麦佛莱 吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's George McFly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.78,1:24:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,借过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.34,1:24:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,暴风雨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The storm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.80,1:24:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 伙计 你们得回去 完成演奏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys, you gotta get back in there and finish the dance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.59,1:24:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 看马文的手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, man. Look at Marvin's hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.09,1:24:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不能弹吉他了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can't play with his hand like that, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.30,1:24:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能没有他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we can't play without him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.51,1:24:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,马文 你必须去演奏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well. Look, Marvin, you got to play.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.06,1:24:28.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他们第一次站在舞池里接吻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, that's where they kiss for the first time on the dance floor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.31,1:24:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,没音乐他们就没法跳舞了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if there's no music, they can't dance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.10,1:24:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不跳舞 他们就不会接吻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they can't dance, they can't kiss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.48,1:24:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不接吻 他们就不会相恋 那我就完蛋了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they can't kiss, they can't fall in love and I'm history.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.94,1:24:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 舞会完了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, man, the dance is over{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.19,1:24:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你找到别人演奏吉他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}unless you know somebody else that can play the guitar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.12,1:24:47.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这首曲子献给所有情人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is for all you lovers out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.12,1:24:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 凡间天使 凡间天使 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Earth angel, Earth angel ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.92,1:24:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你会是我的吗 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Will you be mine? ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.13,1:25:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我亲爱的 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ My darling dear ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.59,1:25:03.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔治 你要吻我吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}George, aren't you going to kiss me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.51,1:25:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.81,1:25:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,走开 乔治·麦佛莱！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scram, McFly. I'm cutting in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.94,1:25:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 人间天使 人间天使 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Earth angel, Earth angel ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.57,1:25:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我喜欢的那个 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ The one I adore ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.49,1:25:24.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子 你还好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, boy, you all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.62,1:25:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没法演奏了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't play.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.16,1:25:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔治！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}George!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.72,1:25:46.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔治！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}George!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.39,1:25:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔治{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}George.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.60,1:25:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.45,1:26:06.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你对幸福的憧憬 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ The vision of your happiness ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.24,1:26:11.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 凡间天使 凡间天使 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Earth angel, Earth angel ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.12,1:26:15.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 请属于我 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Please be mine ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.92,1:26:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我亲爱的 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ My darling dear ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.38,1:26:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 永远爱你 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Love you for all time ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.21,1:26:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我是傻瓜 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I'm just a fool ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.55,1:26:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 爱上你的 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ A fool in love ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.85,1:26:34.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 傻瓜 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ with you ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.11,1:26:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来一曲？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, man, that was good. Let's do another one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.11,1:26:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 我得走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I got to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.11,1:26:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要这样 伙计 该来一首特别的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man. Let's do something that really cooks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.70,1:26:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,一首「特别」的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something that cooks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.88,1:26:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才象话嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.00,1:27:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才象话嘛！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.01,1:27:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.30,1:27:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 这是首老歌…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, this is an oldie, but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.72,1:27:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我那个时代的老歌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's an oldie where I come from.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.15,1:27:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,把调定在 布鲁斯 b 调上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, guys, listen, this is a blues riff in B.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.48,1:27:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意变调 要跟上我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch me for the changes, and try and keep up, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.46,1:27:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 在新奥尔良路易斯安那的路上 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Way down in Louisiana Down in New Orleans ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.38,1:27:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 回到常青树丛中的树林里 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Way back up in the woods among the evergreens ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.26,1:27:49.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 那里有一个用泥土和木头建造的小木屋 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ There stood a log cabin made of earth and wood ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.18,1:27:51.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 那里住着一个叫约翰尼·B·古德的乡下男孩 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Where lived a country boy name of Johnny B. Goode ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.10,1:27:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 他从来没有学过读书写字 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ He never ever learned to read or write so well ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.77,1:27:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 他会弹吉他 就像他在敲钟一样 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ He could play the guitar just like he's ringing a bell ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.31,1:28:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 去吧 去吧 约翰尼 去吧 去吧 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Go, Go, Johnny, go, go ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.86,1:28:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 去吧 约翰尼 去吧 去吧 去吧 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Go, Johnny, go, go, go ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.73,1:28:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 去吧 约翰尼 去吧 去吧 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Go, Johnny, go, go ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.36,1:28:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔治 听说你摆平了贝夫 干得漂亮！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, George, I heard you laid out Biff. Nice going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.07,1:28:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔治 你有没有想过竞选班代表？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}George, you ever think of running for class president?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.45,1:28:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 约翰尼·B·古德 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Johnny B. Goode ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.20,1:28:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 去吧 约翰尼 去吧 去吧 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Go, Johnny, go, go ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.96,1:28:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 去吧 约翰尼 去吧 去吧 去吧 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Go, Johnny, go, go, go ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.71,1:28:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 去吧 约翰尼 去吧 去吧 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Go, Johnny, go, go ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.54,1:28:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 去吧 约翰尼 去吧 去吧 去吧 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Go, Johnny, go, go, go ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.34,1:28:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 约翰尼·B·古德 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Johnny B. Goode ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.47,1:28:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔希 乔希 是我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chuck! Chuck, it's Marvin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.39,1:28:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你表兄马文·贝利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your cousin, Marvin Berry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.06,1:28:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是要全新的音乐吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that new sound you're looking for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.89,1:28:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,来听这个！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, listen to this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.34,1:29:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们现在还不能接受这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess you guys aren't ready for that yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.64,1:29:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你们的孩子会喜欢的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But your kids are going to love it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.52,1:30:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛莲！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lorraine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.98,1:30:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁 曲子很有趣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marty, that was very interesting music.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.65,1:30:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.77,1:30:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你不介意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you don't mind, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.32,1:30:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔治要送我回家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but George asked if he could take me home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.61,1:30:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,棒极了 洛莲！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great! Good. Good, Lorraine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.61,1:30:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有那种感觉了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a feeling about you two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.49,1:30:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我感觉到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a feeling, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.83,1:30:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I got to go, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.29,1:30:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得告诉你 这段时间 很有教育意义{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I wanted to tell you that it's been educational.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.04,1:30:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁 我们还会见面吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marty, will we ever see you again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.71,1:30:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证会的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guarantee it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.01,1:30:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁 感谢你的忠告{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Marty, I want to thank you for all your good advice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.51,1:30:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会忘记的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll never forget it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.55,1:30:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 乔治{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, George.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.52,1:30:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你们好运{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, good luck, you guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.02,1:30:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一件事 如果你们有了孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One other thing. If you guys ever have kids, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.03,1:30:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中的一个在8岁的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and one of them, when he's eight years old, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.53,1:30:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不慎烧坏了客厅的地毯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}accidentally sets fire to the living room rug, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.87,1:31:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,别对他太严厉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}go easy on him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.49,1:31:03.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.67,1:31:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,「马丁」 多好的名字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marty. Such a nice name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.47,1:31:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼！那孩子到哪去了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn! Where is that kid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.81,1:31:24.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.52,1:31:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼！见鬼！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn! Damn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.74,1:31:38.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你迟到了 你有没有时间概念啊？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're late! Do you have no concept of time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.70,1:31:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 我得换件衣服{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, come on. I had to change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.16,1:31:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我能穿这样的衣服回去吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think I'm going back in that zoot suit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.16,1:31:46.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸爸他成功了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The old man really came through. It worked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.91,1:31:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一拳摆平了贝夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He laid out Biff in one punch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.08,1:31:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道他怎么做到的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know he had it in him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.25,1:31:53.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一辈子从来没有这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's never stood up to Biff in his life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.84,1:31:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,从来没有吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.09,1:31:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的！怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Why? What's the matter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.93,1:32:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 让我们现在定目标时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right! Let's set your destination time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.39,1:32:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你离开的时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the exact time you left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.10,1:32:13.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把你送回到相同的时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's send you back at exactly the same time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.44,1:32:18.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,就跟你一直没离开一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be like you never left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.41,1:32:24.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在街道的那边涂了白线{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I painted a white line on the street way over there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.91,1:32:26.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你的出发地点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's where you'll start from.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:26.87,1:32:29.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我精确计算了距离{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've calculated the precise distance, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.29,1:32:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,还考虑了加速度{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}taking into account the acceleration speed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.04,1:32:33.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及风阻力的影响{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and wind resistance retroactive{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.88,1:32:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你到达的时候 闪电刚好发生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}from the moment the lightning strikes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.59,1:32:41.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,准确的说 是7分22秒之后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}which will be in exactly 7 minutes and 22 seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.47,1:32:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,当钟响的时候 你就发动车子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When this alarm goes off, you hit the gas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.93,1:32:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.81,1:32:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想 都准备好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I guess that's everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.07,1:33:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.61,1:33:01.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.83,1:33:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,30 年后见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you in about 30 years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.66,1:33:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但愿如此{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.67,1:33:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.88,1:33:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你以时速88英里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as you hit that wire{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.67,1:33:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,接触到电线的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the connecting hook at precisely 88 miles an hour, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.84,1:33:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪电刚好击中钟楼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the instant the lightning strikes the tower{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.30,1:33:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都会顺利的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}everything will be fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.51,1:33:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.57,1:33:39.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么意思？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the meaning of this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:39.61,1:33:41.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,30年后你会知道的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll find out in 30 years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.36,1:33:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是关于未来的吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about the future, isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:43.53,1:33:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是关于未来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's information about the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.70,1:33:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.32,1:33:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我警告过你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I warned you about this, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.33,1:33:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会导致因果关系的严重灾难！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The consequences could be disastrous!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.25,1:33:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须冒这个险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc, that's a risk you're going to have to take.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.75,1:33:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这关系到你的生命！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your life depends on it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.42,1:33:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.04,1:34:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拒绝接受{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I refuse to accept the responsibility.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.71,1:34:02.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然这样 我就直接告诉你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In that case, I'll tell you straight out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.43,1:34:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great Scott!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.77,1:34:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拿电线 我上去用绳子拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get the cable, I'll throw the rope down to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.90,1:34:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right! I got it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.89,1:34:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.78,1:35:06.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！快点！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on. Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.45,1:35:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了！拉吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right! Take it up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.33,1:35:13.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉呀！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.50,1:35:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.59,1:35:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.80,1:35:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须告诉你未来的事情！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to tell you about the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.34,1:35:27.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:27.47,1:35:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须告诉你未来的事情！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to tell you about the future!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.80,1:35:32.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.22,1:35:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我回去的那晚 你会被…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the night I go back in time, you get…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.56,1:35:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.07,1:35:52.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.16,1:35:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Doc!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.33,1:35:55.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,看时间！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at the time!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.66,1:35:59.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有不到4分钟了！快去！快去！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got less than four minutes. Please, hurry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.26,1:36:12.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.82,1:37:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼！博士 为什么你要撕碎那封信？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it, Doc! Why did you have to tear up that letter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.19,1:37:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,没时间了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I only had more time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:14.16,1:37:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一等 我有的是时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute. I got all the time I want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.62,1:37:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有时间机器 我可以早点回去通知他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a time machine. I can just go back early and warn him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.29,1:37:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 10分钟该足够了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Ten minutes ought to do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.96,1:37:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间电路打开 通量电容器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Time circuit's on. Flux capacitor, fluxing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.13,1:37:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,引擎启动 很好！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Engine running. All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.05,1:37:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！不！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.64,1:37:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,快呀！别出乱子 快呀！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Not this time. Come on. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.30,1:38:52.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,快呀！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.67,1:38:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,发动吧！快！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go. Here we go. This time. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:59.10,1:39:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. Please. Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:40.32,1:40:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:17.88,1:42:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,疯狂的酒鬼！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crazy drunk driver.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:35.10,1:42:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Fred.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:38.86,1:42:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,棒极了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look great. Everything looks great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:42.90,1:42:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,1：24 还有时间 我来也 博士！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}1:24. I still got time. I'm coming, Doc!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.58,1:42:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No, not again! Come on! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:09.10,1:43:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,利比亚人！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Libyans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:33.08,1:43:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:35.45,1:43:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,混蛋！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bastard!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.30,1:43:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,快！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:26.01,1:44:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士 博士！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc! Doc!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:33.60,1:44:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！不！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:50.70,1:44:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还活着！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:01.42,1:45:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,防弹衣？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bulletproof vest?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:04.38,1:45:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么知道的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:06.84,1:45:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没机会告诉你呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never got a chance to tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:22.81,1:45:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是说会影响未来事件？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about all that talk about screwing up future events?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:26.94,1:45:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,破坏时空连续性？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The space-time continuum?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:29.49,1:45:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想 让这理论见鬼去吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I figured, what the hell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:42.62,1:45:44.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 你要去哪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how far ahead are you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:44.67,1:45:47.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,30年之后 很不错的整数字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}About 30 years. It's a nice, round number.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:47.75,1:45:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得去看看我 那时我47岁了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look me up when you get there, all right? Guess I'll be about 47.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:52.30,1:45:53.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:53.97,1:45:55.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,多保重{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take care.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:56.14,1:45:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:57.43,1:45:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 爱因斯坦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Bye-bye, Einie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.27,1:46:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 刚到的时候当心点 有些颠簸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. And watch that re-entry. It's a little bumpy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:03.98,1:46:05.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:10.25,1:47:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是场恶梦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a nightmare.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:23.22,1:47:26.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是爸爸打电话过来 告诉他我今晚要加班{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Paul calls me, tell him I'm working at the boutique late tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:26.27,1:47:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,琳达 我可不是你的电话答录员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Linda, first of all, I'm not your answering service, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:28.44,1:47:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个克雷或是格雷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}second of all, somebody named Greg{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:30.06,1:47:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不久之前打电话给你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or Craig called you just a little while ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:32.02,1:47:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,是哪一个？克雷还是格雷 ？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, which one was it, Greg or Craig?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:33.69,1:47:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 你男友太多了 我可记不住{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know! I can't keep up with all of your boyfriends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:36.49,1:47:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:38.66,1:47:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这到底是怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:41.12,1:47:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是早餐啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breakfast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:42.70,1:47:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你昨晚穿着这身衣服睡觉吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you sleep in your clothes again last night?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:45.20,1:47:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:47.54,1:47:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么这身打扮 戴夫？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. What are you wearing, Dave?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:50.38,1:47:53.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁 我一向穿着西服去办公室啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marty, I always wear a suit to the office.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:54.92,1:47:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还好吗？- 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you all right? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:57.55,1:47:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们得重赛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we need a rematch, George.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:58.72,1:47:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,重赛？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A rematch?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:59.84,1:48:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我在作弊？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? Were you cheating?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:00.97,1:48:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:02.05,1:48:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 早上好！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello. Good morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:06.02,1:48:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 爸爸！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom! Dad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:07.89,1:48:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 伤到头没有？- 马丁！没事吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you hit your head? - Marty, are you all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:09.56,1:48:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们气色真不错！妈妈你真苗条！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys look great. Mom, you look so thin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:13.90,1:48:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 马丁 - 乔治！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why, thank you, Marty. - George!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:17.90,1:48:19.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好 瞌睡虫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning, sleepyhead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:20.91,1:48:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好 戴夫 琳达{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning, Dave. Linda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:22.37,1:48:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好 妈妈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning, Mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:23.83,1:48:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我差点忘了 詹尼弗·帕克 来过电话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marty, I almost forgot. Jennifer Parker called.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:26.41,1:48:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很喜欢她 马丁 她是个可爱的女孩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sure like her, Marty. She is such a sweet girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:30.58,1:48:32.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚是个重要的约会 对吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't tonight the night of the big date?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:32.67,1:48:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What, Ma?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:34.71,1:48:36.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们今晚不是要去湖边吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you going up to the lake tonight?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:36.17,1:48:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为此已计划两周了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been planning it for two weeks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:38.92,1:48:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 我们谈过这件事了 可我怎么去湖边呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom, we talked about this. How can I go to the lake?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:41.68,1:48:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,车不是撞坏了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The car's wrecked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:42.89,1:48:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,撞坏？撞坏？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wrecked? Wrecked?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:44.56,1:48:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么时候发生的？怎么没人告诉我？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When did this happen? Why wasn't I told?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:45.76,1:48:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,别吵了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quiet down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:46.85,1:48:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我肯定车子很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure the car is fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:48.43,1:48:50.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么没人通知我？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why am I always the last one to know about these things?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:50.77,1:48:53.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧 贝夫 正在给车打腊呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See? There's Biff out there waxing it right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:54.27,1:48:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝夫 弄得怎样了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Biff, I want to make sure that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:55.77,1:48:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你打两层腊而不是一层{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we get two coats of wax this time, not just one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:58.69,1:49:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚打好了第二层{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just finishing up the second coat now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:00.36,1:49:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝夫 别骗我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Biff, don't con me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:04.45,1:49:06.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 麦佛莱先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Mr. McFly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:06.58,1:49:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我意思是 我刚刚开始打第二层{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I meant I was just starting on the second coat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:10.75,1:49:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝夫就是这样 总是编故事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Biff. What a character. Always trying to get away with something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:15.09,1:49:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在高中的时候就认识他了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've had to stay on top of Biff ever since high school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:18.13,1:49:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不是他…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although, if it wasn't for him…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:20.30,1:49:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还不会相爱呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We never would have fallen in love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:21.97,1:49:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:23.97,1:49:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦佛莱 先生 麦佛莱 夫人 刚刚到的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. McFly! Mr. McFly, this just arrived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:26.76,1:49:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 马丁！我想是你的新书{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hi, Marty. I think it's your new book.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:32.14,1:49:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 你的第一部小说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey! Your first novel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:36.07,1:49:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉过你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I've always told you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:37.19,1:49:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,「只要一心一意 做什么都成」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"you put your mind to it, you can accomplish anything."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:40.19,1:49:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁 你的钥匙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Marty, here's your keys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:42.78,1:49:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,已为今晚约会打好蜡了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're all waxed up, ready for tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:45.16,1:49:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,钥匙？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keys?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:02.68,1:50:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不要兜兜风 先生？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about a ride, mister?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:04.39,1:50:05.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹尼弗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jennifer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:06.47,1:50:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,真喜欢看到你 让我看看你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, are you a sight for sore eyes! Let me look at you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:11.35,1:50:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁 你好像一周没见我似的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marty, you're acting like you haven't seen me in a week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:14.31,1:50:15.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确如此{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:16.31,1:50:19.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗？一切正常吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay? Is everything all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:22.86,1:50:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:26.20,1:50:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都太好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything is great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:42.21,1:50:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁！你得和我回去！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marty! You've got to come back with me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:47.26,1:50:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,去哪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:48.55,1:50:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,回到未来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back to the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:54.35,1:50:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一等 你在干什么 博士？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute. What are you doing, Doc?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:57.48,1:50:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要燃料{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need fuel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:58.63,1:51:00.05,Note,0,0,0,0,,（高能转换器）
Dialogue: 0,1:51:02.03,1:51:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,快上车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead. Quick! Get in the car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:04.53,1:51:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不 博士 我才刚到这{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. Doc, I just got here, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:06.66,1:51:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹尼弗和我正要开车去兜风{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jennifer's here. We're gonna take the new truck for a spin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:08.74,1:51:11.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,把她带上 这事也和她有关{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, bring her along. This concerns her, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:12.08,1:51:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一等 你在说什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute, Doc. What are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:13.75,1:51:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,未来发生什么事了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happens to us in the future?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:15.87,1:51:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是我们变成呆子或怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do we become assholes or something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:17.71,1:51:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no, Marty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:18.92,1:51:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和詹尼弗感情很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both you and Jennifer turn out fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:20.75,1:51:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,是关于你们的孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your kids, Marty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:22.30,1:51:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,要帮他们办点事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something has got to be done about your kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:30.93,1:51:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士 我们得倒车 没有足够长的路 加速到时速88英里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Doc, we better back up. We don't have enough road to get up to 88.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:34.10,1:51:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,路？我们要去的地方 不需要路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roads? Where we're going, we don't need roads.{\r}
